INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('JetBrains/intellij-community/registry', 'registry', 'JetBrains', 'intellij-community', 'community', 'registry JetBrains intellij-community community The registry skill provides guidelines for using the IntelliJ Registry API, benefiting developers working with IntelliJ IDEA and Platform. It offers documentation on defining registry keys and cloud registry updates IntelliJ IDEA 和 IntelliJ Platform 的注册表设置指南，包括 Registry API 的使用和注册表键的定义 IntelliJ IDEA と IntelliJ Platform のレジストリ設定ガイド。レジストリ API の使用方法とレジストリ キーの定義を含みます IntelliJ IDEA 및 IntelliJ Platform의 레지스트리 설정 가이드입니다. 레지스트리 API 사용법과 레지스트리 키 정의를 포함합니다 El registro de IntelliJ es un sistema que permite a los desarrolladores declarar claves y configurar la plataforma. Aprende a utilizar la API de registro y a declarar claves en plugin.xml o registry.properties. Le registre d''IntelliJ est un système qui permet aux développeurs de déclarer des claves et de configurer la plateforme. Apprenez à utiliser l''API de registre et à déclarer des claves dans plugin.xml ou registry.properties. Das Registrierungssystem von IntelliJ ist ein System, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Schlüssel zu deklarieren und die Plattform zu konfigurieren. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Registrierungs-API verwenden und Schlüssel in plugin.xml oder registry.properties deklarieren. O Registro do IntelliJ é uma API que permite declarar chaves em plugin.xml ou registry.properties, e também suporta atualizações de registro remoto Регистр IntelliJ - это API, который позволяет определять ключи в plugin.xml или registry.properties, и также поддерживает удаленные обновления реестра سجل IntelliJ هو واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تسمح بتعريف المفاتيح في plugin.xml أو registry.properties، ويدعم أيضًا تحديثات السجل عن بُعد how to use registry in IntelliJ what is registry in IntelliJ IDEA registry setup guide for IntelliJ Platform intellij registry api documentation cloud registry updates for jetbrains ide registry vs preferences in intellij registry install for intellij idea intellij registry alternative registry configuration for intellij platform IntelliJ IDEA 注册表 IntelliJ Platform 注册表 Registry API 注册表键 plugin.xml registry.properties 云注册表 AI 工具 Declaring registry keys in plugin.xml or registry.properties Leveraging cloud registry updates for remote configuration management Using the IntelliJ Registry API for customized development Defining registry keys for personalized IDE settings Accessing cloud registry and notifications for JetBrains IDEs Utilizing Registry.md and Cloud Registry and Notifications.md documentation for guided setup Registry is a mechanism for storing and retrieving configuration data in IntelliJ IDEA and Platform, allowing developers to customize and extend the functionality of their IDE');
