ine-builder 사용법","ce-pipeline-builder 설치","ce-pipeline-builder 튜토리얼","AI 도구","개발자 도구","기계 학습"],"es":["cómo utilizar ce-pipeline-builder","qué es explicación calibrada","alternativas a ce-pipeline-builder","ce-pipeline-builder vs otros constructores de pipelines","instalación de ce-pipeline-builder","guía de configuración de ce-pipeline-builder","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para explicaciones calibradas"],"fr":["comment utiliser le constructeur de pipeline CE","qu''est-ce qu''une explication calibrée","alternatives au constructeur de pipeline CE","constructeur de pipeline CE vs autres constructeurs de pipelines","installation du constructeur de pipeline CE","guide de configuration du constructeur de pipeline CE","outils d''agent IA pour explications calibrées"],"de":["wie man den CE-Pipeline-Builder verwendet","was ist kalibrierte Erklärung","Alternativen zum CE-Pipeline-Builder","CE-Pipeline-Builder vs andere Pipeline-Builder","Installation des CE-Pipeline-Builders","Konfigurationsanleitung für den CE-Pipeline-Builder","KI-Tools für kalibrierte Erklärungen"],"pt":["como usar ce-pipeline-builder","o que é explicação calibrada","ce-pipeline-builder alternativa","ce-pipeline-builder vs scikit-explain","instalar ce-pipeline-builder","guias de configuração do ce-pipeline-builder"],"ru":["как использовать CE-пайплайн-билдер","что такое согласованное объяснение","CE-пайплайн-билдер альтернатива","CE-пайплайн-билдер vs scikit-explain","установить CE-пайплайн-билдер","руководства по настройке CE-пайплайн-билдера"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام بناء خط أنابيب CE","ما هي التوضيح المنسق","بناء خط أنابيب CE بديل","بناء خط أنابيب CE vs scikit-explain","تثبيت بناء خط أنابيب CE","دلائل إعداد بناء خط أنابيب CE"]}},"owner":"Moffran","repo":"calibrated_explanations","repoPath":"Moffran/calibrated_explanations","stars":74,"forks":12,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T20:43:37Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ce-pipeline-builder","description":">","bodyPreview":"# CE Pipeline Builder\n\nYou are implementing a CE-first pipeline. Load `references/ce-first-policy.md`\nfor the full policy text. Non-negotiable invariants are repeated inline below\nfor quick reference.\n\n## Mandatory CE-First Checklist (enforce in order)\n\n1. **Library check** — if `calibrated_explanations` is not importable, fail fast:\n   ```python\n   pip install calibrated-explanations\n   ```\n2. **Wrapper** — always use `WrapCalibratedExplainer`. Never invent a new wrapper\n   class; never use `Ca","body":"# CE Pipeline Builder\n\nYou are implementing a CE-first pipeline. Load `references/ce-first-policy.md`\nfor the full policy text. Non-negotiable invariants are repeated inline below\nfor quick reference.\n\n## Mandatory CE-First Checklist (enforce in order)\n\n1. **Library check** — if `calibrated_explanations` is not importable, fail fast:\n   ```python\n   pip install calibrated-explanations\n   ```\n2. **Wrapper** — always use `WrapCalibratedExplainer`. Never invent a new wrapper\n   class; never use `CalibratedExplainer` directly in user-facing code.\n3. **Fit** — `explainer.fit(x_proper, y_proper)`.\n   Assert `explainer.fitted is True` before proceeding.\n4. **Calibrate** — `explainer.calibrate(x_cal, y_cal)`.\n   Assert `explainer.calibrated is True` before proceeding.\n5. **Explain (standard)** — `explainer.explain_factual(X)` or\n   `explainer.explore_alternatives(X)`.\n6. **Explain (guarded / in-distribution)** — when higher security or\n   in-distribution filtering is needed, use `explainer.explain_guarded_factual(X)`\n   or `explainer.explore_guarded_alternatives(X)` instead of the standard paths.\n   Also use when rule conditions of the form `x < feature <= y` are needed, since\n   the guarded APIs support this natively.\n7. **Conjunctions** — `explanations.add_conjunctions(...)` or\n   `explanations[idx].add_conjunctions(...)`.\n8. **Narratives & plots** — `.to_narrative(output_format=...)` and `.plot(...)`.\n9. **Calibrated by default** — never return uncalibrated outputs unless\n   the user has explicitly requested them.\n\n## Minimal Working Skeleton\n\nAdapt the task type (binary / multiclass / regression) based on the user''s\ndata and model. Choose from the three templates below:\n\n### Binary classification\n\n```python\nfrom __future__ import annotations\nimport numpy as np\nfrom calibrated_explanations import WrapCalibratedExplainer\n\n# --- Data split ---------------------------------------------------------\n# x_proper, y_proper : proper training set (used for model training)\n# x_cal, y_cal       : calibration set    (must NOT overlap with x_proper)\n# X_query            : instances to explain\n\n# --- Build pipeline -----------------------------------------------------\nexplainer = WrapCalibratedExplainer(model)           # model: any sklearn-compat\nexplainer.fit(x_proper, y_proper)\nassert explainer.fitted is True\n\nexplainer.calibrate(x_cal, y_cal)\nassert explainer.calibrated is True\n\n# --- Explain ------------------------------------------------------------\nexplanations = explainer.explain_factual(X_query)\n# Optional: add feature conjunctions\nexplanations.add_conjunctions(max_rule_size=3)\n# Optional: narrative\nprint(explanations[0].to_narrative())\n# Optional: plot\nexplanations[0].plot()\n```\n\n### Multiclass classification\n\nSame scaffold as binary. The `explain_factual` call returns one explanation\nobject per query instance, with per-class calibrated probabilities available in\n`explanations[i].prediction[\"__full_probabilities__\"]`.\n\n### Regression (percentile intervals)\n\n```python\nexplainer = WrapCalibratedExplainer(reg_model)\nexplainer.fit(x_proper, y_proper)\nassert explainer.fitted is True\n\nexplainer.calibrate(x_cal, y_cal)\nassert explainer.calibrated is True\n\n# low_high_percentiles controls the conformal interval width (ADR-021)\nexplanations = explainer.explain_factual(X_query, low_high_percentiles=(10, 90))\n```\n\n### Regression (thresholded / probabilistic)\n\n```python\n# threshold= activates the CPS + Venn-Abers path (ADR-021 §3)\nexplanations = explainer.explain_factual(X_query, threshold=my_threshold)\n```\n\n## Using `ce_agent_utils` helpers\n\nPrefer the validated helpers from `src/calibrated_explanations/ce_agent_utils.py`\nfor end-to-end pipelines in agent code:\n\n```python\nfrom calibrated_explanations.ce_agent_utils import (\n    ensure_ce_first_wrapper,\n    fit_and_calibrate,\n    explain_and_narrate,\n    wrap_and_explain,\n)\n\n# Full pipeline in one call:\nexplanations = wrap_and_explain(\n    model, x_proper, y_proper, x_cal, y_cal, X_query\n)\n```\n\n## Decision: `explain_factual` vs `explain_guarded_factual`\n\n| Use case | API to use |\n|---|---|\n| Standard inference | `explain_factual` / `explore_alternatives` |\n| Production / unknown input distribution | `explain_guarded_factual` / `explore_guarded_alternatives` |\n| Explicit in-distribution filtering required | `explain_guarded_factual` |\n\nGuarded variants apply ADR-032 semantics — see `references/adr-032-guarded-semantics.md`.\n\n## Data Split Rules\n\n- `x_proper` / `y_proper` and `x_cal` / `y_cal` must **not** overlap.\n- Typical split: 60% proper training, 20% calibration, 20% test. Adjust based on\n  calibration data needs (larger calibration → tighter intervals).\n- Never reuse training data for calibration.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nThis skill does NOT:\n- Train or tune the underlying model (use your usual scikit-learn workflow).\n- Generate plots or visualizations beyond `.plot()` invocation (see `ce-plotspec-author`).\n- Cover the serialization / persistence of calibrators (see `ce-serializer-impl`).\n- Add new plugins or modify `core/` (see `ce-plugin-scaffold`).\n\n## Evaluation Checklist (self-verify before returning)\n\n- [ ] `WrapCalibratedExplainer` used (not raw `CalibratedExplainer`).\n- [ ] `fit()` called with proper training data.\n- [ ] `calibrate()` called with separate calibration data.\n- [ ] Both `.fitted is True` and `.calibrated is True` asserted.\n- [ ] `explain_factual` or `explore_alternatives` (or guarded variants) called.\n- [ ] No uncalibrated output returned unless explicitly requested.\n- [ ] Skeleton is runnable with the user''s model and data shapes.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T06:21:57.610Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing transparent and explainable pipeline construction with Calibrated Explanations (CE)","zh":"非常适合需要透明和可解释的管道构建的AI代理，具有校准解释（Calibrated Explanations，CE）","ja":"透明で説明可能なパイプライン構築が必要なAIエージェントに最適で、校正説明（Calibrated Explanations、CE）を備えています","ko":"투명하고 설명 가능한 파이프ライン 구성을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 校准된 설명(Calibrated Explanations, CE)을 제공합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan una construcción de tuberías transparente y explicativa con Explicaciones Calibradas (CE)","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une construction de pipeline transparente et explicative avec des explications calibrées (CE)","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine transparente und erklärbare Pipeline-Konstruktion mit kalibrierten Erklärungen (CE) benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de construção de pipeline transparente e explicável com Explicações Calibradas (CE)","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуется прозрачное и объяснимое построение конвейера с откалиброванными объяснениями (CE)","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الإي الأي التي تحتاج إلى بناء трубة شفافة ويمكن تفسيرها مع التفسيرات المُحسّنة (CE)"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce non-negotiable invariants and implement a CE-first pipeline using the `calibrated_explanations` library and `WrapCalibratedExplainer` wrapper, ensuring reliable and trustworthy explanations","zh":"赋予代理人强制执行不可商讨的不变性并使用`calibrated_explanations`库和`WrapCalibratedExplainer`包装器实现CE优先的管道，确保可靠和值得信赖的解释","ja":"エージェントが交渉できない不変性を強制実行し、`calibrated_explanations`ライブラリと`WrapCalibratedExplainer`ラッパーを使用してCE優先のパイプラインを実装することで、信頼性の高い説明を提供します","ko":"에이전트가 협상할 수 없는 불변성을 강제하고 `calibrated_explanations` 라이브러리 및 `WrapCalibratedExplainer` 래퍼를 사용하여 CE-첫 번째 파이프라인을 구현함으로써 신뢰할 수 있는 설명을 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar invariantes no negociables e implementar un pipeline de CE-first utilizando la biblioteca `calibrated_explanations` y el envoltorio `WrapCalibratedExplainer`, garantizando explicaciones confiables y fiables","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des invariants non négociables et de mettre en œuvre un pipeline CE-first en utilisant la bibliothèque `calibrated_explanations` et l''encoche `WrapCalibratedExplainer`, garantissant des explications fiables et dignes de confiance","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, nicht verhandelbare Invarianten durchzusetzen und ein CE-erstes Pipeline mithilfe der `calibrated_explanations`-Bibliothek und des `WrapCalibratedExplainer`-Wrappers umzusetzen, um zuverlässige und vertrauenswürdige Erklärungen sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor invariantes não negociáveis e implementar um pipeline CE-first usando a biblioteca `calibrated_explanations` e o wrapper `WrapCalibratedExplainer`, garantindo explicações confiáveis e dignas de confiança","ru":"Позволяет агентам обеспечивать неизменяемые условия и реализовывать конвейер CE-first с использованием библиотеки `calibrated_explanations` и обертки `WrapCalibratedExplainer`, гарантируя надежные и заслуживающие доверия объяснения","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من فرض ثوابت غير قابلة للتفاوض وتنفيذ трубة CE-first باستخدام مكتبة `calibrated_explanations` ومحوّلة `WrapCalibratedExplainer` ، مما يضمن تفسيرات موثوقة وذات مصداقية"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing mandatory CE-first checklists","Enforcing library checks with `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Building pipelines with `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"zh":["实施强制CE优先的检查清单","使用`pip install calibrated-explanations`强制执行库检查","使用`WrapCalibratedExplainer`构建管道"],"ja":["必須のCE優先のチェックリストを実装する","`pip install calibrated-explanations`を使用してライブラリチェックを強制する","`WrapCalibratedExplainer`を使用してパイプラインを構築する"],"ko":["필수 CE-첫 번째 체크리스트 구현","`pip install calibrated-explanations`를 사용하여 라이브러리 검사 강제","`WrapCalibratedExplainer`를 사용하여 파이프라인 구축"],"es":["Implementar listas de verificación de CE-primero obligatorias","Aplicar controles de biblioteca con `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Crear pipelines con `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des listes de vérification CE-premières obligatoires","Appliquer des contrôles de bibliothèque avec `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Construire des pipelines avec `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"de":["Implementierung obligatorischer CE-erstes Checklisten","Durchsetzung von Bibliotheksprüfungen mit `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Erstellung von Pipelines mit `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"pt":["Implementação de listas de verificação CE-first obrigatórias","Aplicação de verificações de biblioteca com `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Construção de pipelines com `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"ru":["Реализация обязательных контрольных списков CE-first","Применение проверок библиотеки с помощью `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Построение конвейеров с помощью `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"ar":["تنفيذ قوائم التحقق CE-first الإلزامية","تطبيق فحوصات المكتبة باستخدام `pip install calibrated-explanations`","بناء الأنابيب باستخدام `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `calibrated_explanations` library installation","Python environment required for pipeline execution"],"zh":["需要安装`calibrated_explanations`库","需要Python环境来执行管道"],"ja":["`calibrated_explanations`ライブラリのインストールが必要","パイプラインの実行にはPython環境が必要"],"ko":["`calibrated_explanations` 라이브러리 설치 필요","파이프라인 실행을 위해 Python 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la biblioteca `calibrated_explanations`","Se requiere un entorno Python para la ejecución del pipeline"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la bibliothèque `calibrated_explanations`","Un environnement Python est requis pour l''exécution du pipeline"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der `calibrated_explanations`-Bibliothek","Ein Python-Umgebung ist für die Ausführung der Pipeline erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação da biblioteca `calibrated_explanations`","Ambiente Python necessário para execução do pipeline"],"ru":["Требуется установка библиотеки `calibrated_explanations`","Требуется среда Python для выполнения конвейера"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مكتبة `calibrated_explanations`","بيئة بايثون مطلوبة لتشغيل الأنابيب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ae2def778a6daa118ec4edef1a02444ce848e06818b61839b8d66f2ab0efd276","qualityScore":39}');
