à npm-publish"],"de":["AI-Agent-Tools","sichere Anmeldeinformationen","npm-publish","CDP","Sicherheit von Entwicklung","Effizienz von Entwicklung","wie man npm-publish verwendet","was ist npm-publish","Alternativen zu npm-publish"],"pt":["como usar npm-publish","o que é npm-publish","npm-publish vs outras ferramentas","guia de instalação do npm-publish","configuração do npm-publish","ferramentas de segurança para agentes de IA"],"ru":["как использовать npm-publish","что такое npm-publish","npm-publish vs другие инструменты","руководство по установке npm-publish","настройка npm-publish","инструменты безопасности для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة npm-publish","ما هي أداة npm-publish","أداة npm-publish مقابل أدوات أخرى","دليل تثبيت أداة npm-publish","إعداد أداة npm-publish","أدوات الأمان لعميل الإي آي"]}},"owner":"BnayaZil","repo":"agent-vault-cli","repoPath":"BnayaZil/agent-vault-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.846Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"npm-publish","description":"Guide for bumping package versions and publishing to npm via CI/CD. Use when the user asks about publishing, releasing, version bumping, or deploying to npm.","bodyPreview":"# NPM Publish Workflow\n\nThis project uses GitHub Actions CI/CD to automatically publish to npm when a version tag is pushed.\n\n## Quick Publish\n\n```bash\n# 1. Bump the version (updates package.json and creates a git tag)\nnpm version patch   # 0.1.0 -> 0.1.1\nnpm version minor   # 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0\nnpm version major   # 0.1.0 -> 1.0.0\n\n# 2. Push to trigger CI/CD\ngit push && git push --tags\n```\n\nThe CI pipeline will automatically:\n- Run tests on multiple platforms (Ubuntu, macOS) and Node versions (18,","body":"# NPM Publish Workflow\n\nThis project uses GitHub Actions CI/CD to automatically publish to npm when a version tag is pushed.\n\n## Quick Publish\n\n```bash\n# 1. Bump the version (updates package.json and creates a git tag)\nnpm version patch   # 0.1.0 -> 0.1.1\nnpm version minor   # 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0\nnpm version major   # 0.1.0 -> 1.0.0\n\n# 2. Push to trigger CI/CD\ngit push && git push --tags\n```\n\nThe CI pipeline will automatically:\n- Run tests on multiple platforms (Ubuntu, macOS) and Node versions (18, 20)\n- Build the project\n- Publish to npm if all tests pass\n\n## Version Types\n\n| Command | Use When | Example |\n|---------|----------|---------|\n| `npm version patch` | Bug fixes, small updates | 0.1.0 → 0.1.1 |\n| `npm version minor` | New features, backwards compatible | 0.1.0 → 0.2.0 |\n| `npm version major` | Breaking changes | 0.1.0 → 1.0.0 |\n\n## Pre-release Versions\n\n```bash\nnpm version prerelease --preid=alpha  # 0.1.0 -> 0.1.1-alpha.0\nnpm version prerelease --preid=beta   # 0.1.0 -> 0.1.1-beta.0\nnpm version prerelease --preid=rc     # 0.1.0 -> 0.1.1-rc.0\n```\n\n## Setup (One-time)\n\nAdd `NPM_TOKEN` to GitHub repository secrets:\n1. Generate token at https://www.npmjs.com/settings/[username]/tokens\n2. Add to GitHub repo: Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository secret\n3. Name: `NPM_TOKEN`, Value: [your token]\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**CI fails to publish?**\n- Verify `NPM_TOKEN` is set in GitHub secrets\n- Check if version already exists on npm\n- Review GitHub Actions logs\n\n**Need to skip CI tests?**\n- Not recommended, but you can manually publish: `npm publish --access public`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:48:13.509Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated package publishing to npm via GitHub Actions CI/CD","zh":"适用于需要通过 GitHub Actions CI/CD 自动将包发布到 npm 的 AI Agent","ja":"GitHub Actions CI/CD を使用して npm にパッケージを自動的に公開する必要がある AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"GitHub Actions CI/CD를 통해 npm에 패키지를 자동으로发布해야 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan publicación de paquetes automatizada en npm a través de GitHub Actions CI/CD","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant une publication de packages automatisée sur npm via GitHub Actions CI/CD","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte Paketveröffentlichung auf npm über GitHub Actions CI/CD benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de publicação automática de pacotes para npm via GitHub Actions CI/CD","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется автоматическая публикация пакетов в npm через GitHub Actions CI/CD","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر حزم تلقائي إلى npm عبر GitHub Actions CI/CD"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to publish packages to npm using secure credential vault CLI, filling login forms via CDP without exposing credentials, and automating testing on multiple platforms and Node versions","zh":"赋予代理通过安全凭证vault CLI 将包发布到 npm 的能力，使用 CDP 填写登录表单而无需暴露凭证，并在多个平台和 Node 版本上自动执行测试","ja":"エージェントに、セキュアな資格情報ボールト CLI を使用して npm にパッケージを公開し、CDP を使用してログインフォームを埋めつつ資格情報を公開せずに、また複数のプラットフォームと Node バージョン上で自動テストを実行する能力を付与します","ko":"에이전트에게 보안 자격증명 보관소 CLI를 사용하여 npm에 패키지를发布하고, CDP를 사용하여 로그인 양식을 채우면서 자격증명을 공개하지 않고, 여러 플랫폼과 Node 버전에서 자동 테스트를 실행하는 능력을 부여합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar paquetes en npm utilizando un vault de credenciales seguro CLI, rellenando formularios de inicio de sesión a través de CDP sin exponer credenciales, y automatizando pruebas en múltiples plataformas y versiones de Node","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier des packages sur npm en utilisant un coffre d''informations d''identification sécurisé CLI, en remplissant les formulaires de connexion via CDP sans exposer les informations d''identification, et en automatisant les tests sur plusieurs plateformes et versions de Node","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Pakete auf npm zu veröffentlichen, indem sie einen sicheren Credential-Vault-CLI verwenden, Anmeldeformulare über CDP ausfüllen, ohne Anmeldeinformationen offenzulegen, und Tests auf mehreren Plattformen und Node-Versionen automatisieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a publicar pacotes para npm usando um cofre de credenciais seguro CLI, preenchendo formulários de login via CDP sem expor credenciais, e automatizando testes em várias plataformas e versões do Node","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать пакеты в npm, используя защищенный хранилище учетных данных CLI, заполнение форм входа через CDP без раскрытия учетных данных, и автоматизацию тестирования на нескольких платформах и версиях Node","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر الحزم إلى npm باستخدام خزنة أمان CLI ، وتعبئة نماذج تسجيل الدخول عبر CDP دون الكشف عن الأمان ، وتحسين الاختبارات على منصات متعددة وإصدارات Node"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating npm package publishing","Triggering CI/CD pipelines with version tags","Running tests on multiple platforms and Node versions"],"zh":["自动化 npm 包发布","使用版本标签触发 CI/CD 流水线","在多个平台和 Node 版本上运行测试"],"ja":["npm パッケージの自動公開","バージョンタグを使用して CI/CD パイプラインをトリガーする","複数のプラットフォームと Node バージョン上でテストを実行する"],"ko":["npm 패키지 자동发布","버전 태그를 사용하여 CI/CD 파이프라인을 트리거하는 것","여러 플랫폼과 Node 버전에서 테스트를 실행하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la publicación de paquetes npm","Activación de tuberías CI/CD con etiquetas de versión","Ejecución de pruebas en múltiples plataformas y versiones de Node"],"fr":["Automatisation de la publication de packages npm","Déclenchement de pipelines CI/CD avec des balises de version","Exécution de tests sur plusieurs plateformes et versions de Node"],"de":["Automatisierung der Veröffentlichung von npm-Paketen","Auslösen von CI/CD-Pipelines mit Versionstags","Ausführen von Tests auf mehreren Plattformen und Node-Versionen"],"pt":["Automizar a publicação de pacotes npm","Acionar pipelines CI/CD com tags de versão","Executar testes em várias plataformas e versões do Node"],"ru":["Автоматизировать публикацию пакетов npm","Запускать конвейеры CI/CD с тегами версий","Выполнять тесты на нескольких платформах и версиях Node"],"ar":["توفير автомatisation لنشر الحزم npm","تشغيل أنابيب CI/CD مع علامات الإصدار","تشغيل الاختبارات على منصات متعددة وإصدارات Node"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Actions CI/CD setup","Node versions 18+ supported","Git and npm versioning required"],"zh":["需要 GitHub Actions CI/CD 设置","支持 Node 版本 18+","需要 Git 和 npm 版本管理"],"ja":["GitHub Actions CI/CD の設定が必要","Node バージョン 18+ がサポートされている","Git と npm のバージョニングが必要"],"ko":["GitHub Actions CI/CD 설정이 필요함","Node 버전 18+ 지원","Git 및 npm 버전 관리 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de GitHub Actions CI/CD","Se admiten versiones de Node 18+","Se requiere versionado de Git y npm"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de GitHub Actions CI/CD","Prend en charge les versions de Node 18+","Nécessite un versionnage Git et npm"],"de":["Benötigt eine GitHub Actions CI/CD-Konfiguration","Unterstützt Node-Versionen 18+","Benötigt Git- und npm-Versionierung"],"pt":["Requer configuração do GitHub Actions CI/CD","Versões do Node 18+ suportadas","Versionamento do Git e npm necessário"],"ru":["Требует настройки GitHub Actions CI/CD","Поддерживаются версии Node 18+","Требуется версионирование Git и npm"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد GitHub Actions CI/CD","دعم إصدارات Node 18+","مطلوب إصدار Git و npm"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"74b8219f542b5438dca57ef2c9c36b559abb4c9937780c9921a06ed8dd488826","qualityScore":39}');
