","開発効率の向上","複数のブラウザをサポート","使いやすいCLIインターフェイス"],"ko":["Playwright 코드의 기록 및 생성","선택자의 검사","웹 페이지의 스크린샷 캡처","개발 효율성의 향상","다중 브라우저 지원","사용하기 쉬운 CLI 인터페이스"],"es":["Grabación y generación de código Playwright","Inspección de selectores","Captura de pantallas","Interfaz de línea de comandos","Automatización de tareas"],"fr":["Enregistrement et génération de code Playwright","Inspection de sélecteurs","Capture d''écrans","Interface de ligne de commande","Automatisation de tâches"],"de":["Aufzeichnung und Generierung von Playwright-Code","Inspektion von Selektoren","Bildschirmfotos","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Gravação e geração de código Playwright","Inspecção de seletores","Captura de screenshots","Automação de tarefas com Playwright","Interface de linha de comando"],"ru":["Запись и генерация кода Playwright","Инспекция селекторов","Сделать скриншот","Автоматизация задач с Playwright","Интерфейс командной строки"],"ar":["تسجيل وإنشاء код Playwright","فحص محددات","تصوير الشاشة","الautomatisation المهام مع Playwright","واجهة سطر الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Playwright-cli","Playwright-cli教程","Playwright代码生成","选择器检查工具","网页截图工具","Playwright-cli安装","Playwright-cli设置指南","Playwright-cli替代品","Playwright-cli vs Selenium"],"ja":["Playwright-cliの使い方","Playwright-cliチュートリアル","Playwrightコードの生成","セレクター検査ツール","Webページスクリーンショットツール","Playwright-cliのインストール","Playwright-cliの設定ガイド","Playwright-cliの代替品","Playwright-cli vs Selenium"],"ko":["Playwright-cli 사용법","Playwright-cli 튜토리얼","Playwright 코드 생성","선택자 검사 도구","웹 페이지 스크린샷 도구","Playwright-cli 설치","Playwright-cli 설정 가이드","Playwright-cli 대체품","Playwright-cli vs Selenium"],"es":["cómo usar playwright-cli","qué es playwright","alternativas a playwright","playwright vs selenium","instalación de playwright-cli","guía de configuración de playwright"],"fr":["comment utiliser playwright-cli","qu''est-ce que playwright","alternatives à playwright","playwright vs selenium","installation de playwright-cli","guide de configuration de playwright"],"de":["wie man playwright-cli verwendet","was ist playwright","alternativen zu playwright","playwright vs selenium","installation von playwright-cli","konfigurationsanleitung für playwright"],"pt":["como usar Playwright-CLI","o que é Playwright-CLI","Playwright-CLI alternative","Playwright-CLI vs Selenium","instalar Playwright-CLI","guia de configuração do Playwright-CLI"],"ru":["как использовать Playwright-CLI","что такое Playwright-CLI","Playwright-CLI альтернатива","Playwright-CLI vs Selenium","установить Playwright-CLI","руководство по настройке Playwright-CLI"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Playwright-CLI","ما هو Playwright-CLI","بديل Playwright-CLI","Playwright-CLI مقابل Selenium","تثبيت Playwright-CLI","دليل إعداد Playwright-CLI"]}},"owner":"microsoft","repo":"playwright-cli","repoPath":"microsoft/playwright-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.928Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-cli","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# open new browser\nplaywright-cli open\n# navigate to a page\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\n# interact with the page using refs from the snapshot\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n# take a screenshot (rarely used, as snapshot is more common)\nplaywright-cli screenshot\n# close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open\n# open","body":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# open new browser\nplaywright-cli open\n# navigate to a page\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\n# interact with the page using refs from the snapshot\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n# take a screenshot (rarely used, as snapshot is more common)\nplaywright-cli screenshot\n# close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open\n# open and navigate right away\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\nplaywright-cli type \"search query\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli dblclick e7\nplaywright-cli fill e5 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli drag e2 e8\nplaywright-cli hover e4\nplaywright-cli select e9 \"option-value\"\nplaywright-cli upload ./document.pdf\nplaywright-cli check e12\nplaywright-cli uncheck e12\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli snapshot --filename=after-click.yaml\nplaywright-cli eval \"document.title\"\nplaywright-cli eval \"el => el.textContent\" e5\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept \"confirmation text\"\nplaywright-cli dialog-dismiss\nplaywright-cli resize 1920 1080\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli go-back\nplaywright-cli go-forward\nplaywright-cli reload\n```\n\n### Keyboard\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli press Enter\nplaywright-cli press ArrowDown\nplaywright-cli keydown Shift\nplaywright-cli keyup Shift\n```\n\n### Mouse\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli mousemove 150 300\nplaywright-cli mousedown\nplaywright-cli mousedown right\nplaywright-cli mouseup\nplaywright-cli mouseup right\nplaywright-cli mousewheel 0 100\n```\n\n### Save as\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot e5\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=page.png\nplaywright-cli pdf --filename=page.pdf\n```\n\n### Tabs\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-new\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/page\nplaywright-cli tab-close\nplaywright-cli tab-close 2\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\n```\n\n### Storage\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli state-save\nplaywright-cli state-save auth.json\nplaywright-cli state-load auth.json\n\n# Cookies\nplaywright-cli cookie-list\nplaywright-cli cookie-list --domain=example.com\nplaywright-cli cookie-get session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123 --domain=example.com --httpOnly --secure\nplaywright-cli cookie-delete session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-clear\n\n# LocalStorage\nplaywright-cli localstorage-list\nplaywright-cli localstorage-get theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-set theme dark\nplaywright-cli localstorage-delete theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-clear\n\n# SessionStorage\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-list\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-get step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-set step 3\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-delete step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-clear\n```\n\n### Network\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli route \"**/*.jpg\" --status=404\nplaywright-cli route \"https://api.example.com/**\" --body=''{\"mock\": true}''\nplaywright-cli route-list\nplaywright-cli unroute \"**/*.jpg\"\nplaywright-cli unroute\n```\n\n### DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli console warning\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli run-code \"async page => await page.context().grantPermissions([''geolocation''])\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\nplaywright-cli video-start\nplaywright-cli video-stop video.webm\n```\n\n## Open parameters\n```bash\n# Use specific browser when creating session\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chrome\nplaywright-cli open --browser=firefox\nplaywright-cli open --browser=webkit\nplaywright-cli open --browser=msedge\n# Connect to browser via extension\nplaywright-cli open --extension\n\n# Use persistent profile (by default profile is in-memory)\nplaywright-cli open --persistent\n# Use persistent profile with custom directory\nplaywright-cli open --profile=/path/to/profile\n\n# Start with config file\nplaywright-cli open --config=my-config.json\n\n# Close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n# Delete user data for the default session\nplaywright-cli delete-data\n```\n\n## Snapshots\n\nAfter each command, playwright-cli provides a snapshot of the current browser state.\n\n```bash\n> playwright-cli goto https://example.com\n### Page\n- Page URL: https://example.com/\n- Page Title: Example Domain\n### Snapshot\n[Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-02-14T19-22-42-679Z.yml)\n```\n\nYou can also take a snapshot on demand using `playwright-cli snapshot` command.\n\nIf `--filename` is not provided, a new snapshot file is created with a timestamp. Default to automatic file naming, use `--filename=` when artifact is a part of the workflow result.\n\n## Browser Sessions\n\n```bash\n# create new browser session named \"mysession\" with persistent profile\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession open example.com --persistent\n# same with manually specified profile directory (use when requested explicitly)\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession open example.com --profile=/path/to/profile\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession click e6\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession close  # stop a named browser\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession delete-data  # delete user data for persistent session\n\nplaywright-cli list\n# Close all browsers\nplaywright-cli close-all\n# Forcefully kill all browser processes\nplaywright-cli kill-all\n```\n\n## Local installation\n\nIn some cases user might want to install playwright-cli locally. If running globally available `playwright-cli` binary fails, use `npx playwright-cli` to run the commands. For example:\n\n```bash\nnpx playwright-cli open https://example.com\nnpx playwright-cli click e1\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/form\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n\nplaywright-cli fill e1 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli fill e2 \"password123\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Example: Multi-tab workflow\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/other\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Example: Debugging with DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Specific tasks\n\n* **Request mocking** [references/request-mocking.md](references/request-mocking.md)\n* **Running Playwright code** [references/running-code.md](references/running-code.md)\n* **Browser session management** [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md)\n* **Storage state (cookies, localStorage)** [references/storage-state.md](references/storage-state.md)\n* **Test generation** [references/test-generation.md](references/test-generation.md)\n* **Tracing** [references/tracing.md](references/tracing.md)\n* **Video recording** [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:05:59.979Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Browser Automation Agents needing advanced Playwright code generation and browser interaction capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级Playwright代码生成和浏览器交互能力的浏览器自动化代理。","ja":"ブラウザの自動化エージェントが高度なPlaywrightコード生成とブラウザの相互作用機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 Playwright 코드 생성 및 브라우저 상호 작용 기능이 필요한 브라우저 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de navegador que necesitan generación de código Playwright avanzado y capacidades de interacción con el navegador.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de navigateur nécessitant une génération de code Playwright avancée et des capacités d''interaction avec le navigateur.","de":"Perfekt für Browser-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Playwright-Codegenerierung und Browser-Interaktionsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Navegador que precisam de geração avançada de código Playwright e capacidades de interação com o navegador.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации браузера, требующих продвинутой генерации кода Playwright и возможностей взаимодействия с браузером.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء آليين في المتصفح الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد متقدم من رمز Playwright وقدرات التفاعل مع المتصفح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using Playwright, enabling features like recording and generating Playwright code, inspecting selectors, and taking screenshots via protocols like HTTPS, utilizing libraries such as Playwright for browser automation.","zh":"赋予代理使用Playwright自动化浏览器交互的能力，实现录制和生成Playwright代码、检查选择器以及通过HTTPS等协议使用截图和快照功能，利用Playwright等库进行浏览器自动化。","ja":"エージェントがPlaywrightを使用してブラウザの相互作用を自動化する機能を提供し、Playwrightコードの記録と生成、セレクタの調査、HTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用したスクリーンショットとスナップショット機能などを可能にします。ブラウザの自動化にはPlaywrightなどのライブラリを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright를 사용하여 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 Playwright 코드의 기록 및 생성, 선택기 조사, HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 스크린샷 및 스냅샷 기능 등을 가능하게 합니다. 브라우저 자동화에는 Playwright와 같은 라이브러리를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones del navegador mediante Playwright, lo que permite funciones como grabar y generar código Playwright, inspeccionar selectores y tomar capturas de pantalla a través de protocolos como HTTPS, utilizando bibliotecas como Playwright para la automatización del navegador.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions de navigateur à l''aide de Playwright, ce qui permet des fonctionnalités telles que l''enregistrement et la génération de code Playwright, l''inspection des sélecteurs et la capture d''écran via des protocoles tels que HTTPS, en utilisant des bibliothèques telles que Playwright pour l''automatisation du navigateur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Browser-Interaktionen mithilfe von Playwright zu automatisieren, wodurch Funktionen wie Aufzeichnen und Generieren von Playwright-Code, Inspektion von Selektoren und Aufnahme von Screenshots über Protokolle wie HTTPS ermöglicht werden, unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie Playwright für die Browser-Automatisierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações de navegador usando Playwright, permitindo recursos como gravação e geração de código Playwright, inspeção de seletor e captura de tela por meio de protocolos como HTTPS, utilizando bibliotecas como Playwright para automação de navegador.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера с помощью Playwright, обеспечивая функции, такие как запись и генерация кода Playwright, инспекция селекторов и захват экрана через протоколы, такие как HTTPS, используя библиотеки, такие как Playwright для автоматизации браузера.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على 자동 أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح باستخدام Playwright، وتمكين الميزات مثل التسجيل وتوليد رمز Playwright، وفحص المحددات، وتسجيل الشاشة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS، باستخدام مكتبات مثل Playwright لأتمتة المتصفح."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser interactions for testing purposes","Generating Playwright code for complex user flows","Debugging browser issues using screenshot and snapshot features"],"zh":["用于测试目的的浏览器交互自动化","为复杂用户流生成Playwright代码","使用截图和快照功能调试浏览器问题"],"ja":["テスト目的のブラウザの相互作用の自動化","複雑なユーザーフロー用のPlaywrightコードの生成","スクリーンショットとスナップショット機能を使用したブラウザの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["테스트 목적의 브라우저 상호 작용 자동화","복잡한 사용자 흐름을 위한 Playwright 코드 생성","스크린샷 및 스냅샷 기능을 사용한 브라우저 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones de navegador para fines de prueba","Generar código Playwright para flujos de usuario complejos","Depurar problemas de navegador mediante características de captura y instantánea de pantalla"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions de navigateur à des fins de test","Générer du code Playwright pour des flux d''utilisateurs complexes","Déboguer les problèmes de navigateur à l''aide de fonctionnalités de capture et d''instantané d''écran"],"de":["Automatisieren von Browser-Interaktionen für Testzwecke","Generieren von Playwright-Code für komplexe Benutzerabläufe","Beheben von Browser-Problemen mithilfe von Screenshot- und Snapshot-Funktionen"],"pt":["Automatizar interações de navegador para fins de teste","Gerar código Playwright para fluxos de usuário complexos","Depurar problemas de navegador usando recursos de captura de tela e instantâneo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера для целей тестирования","Генерировать код Playwright для сложных потоков пользователей","Отлаживать проблемы браузера, используя функции захвата экрана и снимка"],"ar":["أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح لأغراض الاختبار","توليد رمز Playwright لتدفقات المستخدم المعقدة","تصحيح أخطاء المتصفح باستخدام ميزات تسجيل الشاشة واللقطة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright installation","Limited to browser automation tasks"],"zh":["需要安装Playwright","仅限于浏览器自动化任务"],"ja":["Playwrightのインストールが必要","ブラウザの自動化タスクのみに限定"],"ko":["Playwright 설치가 필요","브라우저 자동화 작업만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Playwright","Limitado a tareas de automatización de navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Playwright","Limité aux tâches d''automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Playwright","Begrenzt auf Browser-Automatisierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Playwright","Limitado a tarefas de automação de navegador"],"ru":["Требует установки Playwright","Ограничен задачами автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Playwright","محدود بمهام أتمتة المتصفح"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"716a80315821d6694f8ca1331c1e03ecbdf33c88ce8b4042c7684b4c4ff5e4dc","qualityScore":39}');
