INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('microsoft/playwright-cli/playwright-cli', 'playwright-cli', 'microsoft', 'playwright-cli', 'community', 'playwright-cli microsoft playwright-cli community Playwright-cli是用于记录和生成Playwright代码、检查选择器和截取网页屏幕截图的CLI工具 Playwright-cliはPlaywrightコードを記録・生成し、セレクターを検査し、Webページのスクリーンショットを取得するCLIツール Playwright-cli는 Playwright 코드를 기록하고 생성하며 선택자를 검사하고 웹 페이지의 스크린샷을 캡처하는 CLI 도구 Playwright-cli es una herramienta de línea de comandos para acciones comunes de Playwright, que permite grabar y generar código, inspeccionar selectores y capturar pantallas Playwright-cli est un outil de ligne de commande pour les actions courantes de Playwright, qui permet d''enregistrer et de générer du code, d''inspecter des sélecteurs et de capturer des écrans Playwright-cli ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool für gängige Playwright-Aktionen, mit dem Sie Code aufzeichnen und generieren, Selektoren inspizieren und Bildschirmfotos machen können O Playwright-CLI é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para automação de tarefas com Playwright, permitindo gravar e gerar código, inspecionar seletores e tirar screenshots. Playwright-CLI — это инструмент командной строки для автоматизации задач с Playwright, позволяющий записывать и генерировать код, инспектировать селекторы и делать скриншоты. Playwright-CLI هي أداة سطر الأوامر للautomatisation المهام مع Playwright، مما يسمح بتسجيل وإنشاء код، وفحص محددات وتصوير الشاشة. CLI for common Playwright actions. Record and generate Playwright code, inspect selectors and take screenshots. 如何使用Playwright-cli Playwright-cli教程 Playwright代码生成 选择器检查工具 网页截图工具 Playwright-cli安装 Playwright-cli设置指南 Playwright-cli替代品 Playwright-cli vs Selenium CLI for common Playwright actions. Record and generate Playwright code, inspect selectors and take screenshots.');
