AIエージェント","ja":"Verification Before Completion ベストプラクティス - AIエージェント","ko":"Verification Before Completion 설정 가이드 - AI 도구","es":"Configuración de verificación antes de finalización: Guía...","fr":"Verification avant achèvement: Meilleures pratiques de mi...","de":"Verifizierung vor Abschluss: Einrichtungsanleitung für En...","pt":"Verificação Antes da Conclusão: Guia de Configuração com ...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Верификация Перед Завершением - Руководство по...","ar":"التحقق من الصحة قبل الإكمال: إرشادات الإعداد مع Playwright"},"description":{"en":"Learn how to implement verification-before-completion in your AI agent workflow. Discover the importance of evidence-based claims and get started with our ex...","zh":"了解 verification-before-completion 技术，确保工作完成前验证，提高效率和可靠性","ja":"Verification Before Completion 技術をマスターし、労働の完成前に検証を行う","ko":"Verification Before Completion 기술로 작업 완료 전 검증을 수행하고 효율성 및 신뢰성을 높이세요","es":"Aprende a implementar la verificación antes de la finalización en tu proyecto con nuestra guía paso a paso y mejora la calidad de tu código","fr":"Découvrez comment mettre en œuvre la vérification avant l''achèvement pour améliorer la qualité de votre code et réduire les erreurs","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Verifizierung vor dem Abschluss in Ihrem Projekt implementieren und die Code-Qualität verbessern können","pt":"Aprenda a implementar a verificação antes da conclusão em seu projeto com Playwright. Evite reivindicações de conclusão sem evidências.","ru":"Узнайте, как реализовать верификацию перед завершением в вашем проекте с помощью Playwright. Избегайте заявлений о завершении без доказательств.","ar":"تعرف على كيفية تنفيذ التحقق من الصحة قبل الإكمال في مشروعك مع Playwright. تجنب المطالبات بالإكمال بدون أدلة"},"definition":{"en":"Verification-before-completion is a development principle that requires evidence before claims, ensuring that completion claims are backed by fresh verification evidence.","zh":"Verification Before Completion 是一种技术原则，要求在完成工作之前提供验证证据","ja":"Verification Before Completion は、仕事が完了する前に検証証拠を提供することを要求する技術原則である","ko":"Verification Before Completion은 작업 완료 전 검증 증거를 제공해야 하는 기술 원칙입니다","es":"La verificación antes de la finalización es un proceso que garantiza la evidencia de verificación antes de reclamar la finalización de una tarea","fr":"La vérification avant l''achèvement est un processus qui garantit la preuve de vérification avant de revendiquer l''achèvement d''une tâche","de":"Die Verifizierung vor dem Abschluss ist ein Prozess, der die Verifizierungsevidenz vor dem Abschluss einer Aufgabe sicherstellt","pt":"Verificação antes da conclusão é a prática de fornecer evidências de verificação antes de reivindicar a conclusão de uma tarefa.","ru":"Верификация перед завершением - это практика предоставления доказательств верификации перед заявлением о завершении задачи.","ar":"التحقق من الصحة قبل الإكمال هو ممارسة تقديم أدلة التحقق قبل المطالبة بالإكمال"},"features":{"en":["Enforces the core principle of evidence before claims","Requires running verification commands in the terminal for visibility","Violating the letter of this rule is considered violating the spirit of this rule","Implements the Iron Law: NO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE","Supports running npx playwright in the terminal for verification"],"zh":["使用 npx playwright 命令进行验证","在终端中运行命令以确保可见性","提供验证证据以支持完成声明","遵循 Iron Law 原则：无验证证据不予完成声明","确保工作完成前验证以提高效率和可靠性"],"ja":["npx playwright コマンドを使用して検証を行う","ターミナルでコマンドを実行して可視性を確保する","検証証拠を提供して完了声明を支援する","Iron Law 原則に従う：検証証拠なしは完了声明なし","労働の完成前に検証を行って効率と信頼性を高める"],"ko":["npx playwright 명령을 사용하여 검증을 수행한다","터미널에서 명령을 실행하여 가시성을 보장한다","검증 증거를 제공하여 완료 선언을 지원한다","Iron Law 원칙을 준수한다: 검증 증거 없이 완료 선언은 없다","작업 완료 전 검증을 수행하여 효율성과 신뢰성을 높인다"],"es":["Ejecución de comandos de verificación en el terminal para garantizar la visibilidad","Implementación de la regla de no reclamar la finalización sin evidencia de verificación fresca","Uso de tecnologías como Playwright para la automatización de pruebas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como PierceDesk","Aplicación de la Ley de Hierro de la verificación antes de la finalización"],"fr":["Exécution de commandes de vérification dans le terminal pour assurer la visibilité","Mise en œuvre de la règle de non-revendication de l''achèvement sans preuve de vérification fraîche","Utilisation de technologies comme Playwright pour l''automatisation des tests","Intégration avec des outils de développement comme PierceDesk","Application de la Loi de Fer de la vérification avant l''achèvement"],"de":["Ausführung von Verifizierungsbefehlen im Terminal für die Sicherstellung der Sichtbarkeit","Implementierung der Regel, keine Fertigstellung ohne frische Verifizierungsevidenz zu beanspruchen","Verwendung von Technologien wie Playwright für die Automatisierung von Tests","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie PierceDesk","Anwendung des Eisernen Gesetzes der Verifizierung vor dem Abschluss"],"pt":["Uso de Playwright para verificação de tarefas","Execução de comandos de verificação em terminal para visibilidade","Evita reivindicações de conclusão sem evidências","Garante a integridade do projeto com verificação antes da conclusão","Compatibilidade com CLI para automação de tarefas"],"ru":["Использование Playwright для верификации задач","Выполнение команд верификации в терминале для видимости","Избегает заявлений о завершении без доказательств","Гарантирует целостность проекта с верификацией перед завершением","Совместимость с CLI для автоматизации задач"],"ar":["استخدام Playwright للتحقق من المهمات","تشغيل أوامر التحقق في الطرفية من أجل الرؤية","تجنب المطالبات بالإكمال بدون أدلة","ضمان سلامة المشروع مع التحقق من الصحة قبل الإكمال","التوافق مع CLI لأتمتة المهام"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use verification-before-completion","what is verification-before-completion","verification-before-completion alternative","verification-before-completion setup guide","verification-before-completion install","npx playwright verification","evidence-based claims in AI development","verification-before-completion best practices"],"zh":["verification-before-completion","AIエージェント","npx playwright","终端可见性","验证证据","Iron Law","技术原则","完成声明","效率和可靠性"],"ja":["Verification Before Completion","AIエージェント","npx playwright","ターミナル可視性","検証証拠","Iron Law","技術原則","完了声明","効率と信頼性"],"ko":["Verification Before Completion","AI 도구","npx playwright","터미널 가시성","검증 증거","Iron Law","기술 원칙","완료 선언","효율성과 신뢰성"],"es":["verificación antes de la finalización","pruebas automatizadas","Playwright","PierceDesk","desarrollo de software","calidad del código","herramientas de desarrollo","Agente de IA","Herramientas de IA"],"fr":["vérification avant l''achèvement","tests automatisés","Playwright","PierceDesk","développement de logiciels","qualité du code","outils de développement","Agent IA","Outils IA"],"de":["Verifizierung vor dem Abschluss","automatisierte Tests","Playwright","PierceDesk","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität","Entwicklungstools","KI-Agent","KI-Tools"],"pt":["verificação antes da conclusão","playwright","CLI","automatização de tarefas","integridade do projeto","evidências de verificação","desenvolvimento de software","testes automatizados"],"ru":["верификация перед завершением","playwright","CLI","автоматизация задач","целостность проекта","доказательства верификации","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматические тесты"],"ar":["التحقق من الصحة قبل الإكمال","playwright","CLI","أتمتة المهام","سلامة المشروع","أدلة التحقق","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات آلية"]}},"owner":"RockwallJMC","repo":"Threadbilt-v0","repoPath":"RockwallJMC/Threadbilt-v0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:59:22.202Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verification-before-completion","description":"Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing changes - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always","bodyPreview":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n**DONT run npx playwright in the background, run in terminal for visibility**\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it pa","body":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n**DONT run npx playwright in the background, run in terminal for visibility**\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing satisfaction:\n\n1. IDENTIFY: What command proves this claim?\n2. RUN: Execute the FULL command (fresh, complete)\n3. READ: Full output, check exit code, count failures\n4. VERIFY: Does output confirm the claim?\n   - If NO: State actual status with evidence\n   - If YES: State claim WITH evidence\n5. ONLY THEN: Make the claim\n\nSkip any step = lying, not verifying\n```\n\n## Common Failures\n\n| Claim                 | Requires                        | Not Sufficient                 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Tests pass            | Test command output: 0 failures | Previous run, \"should pass\"    |\n| Linter clean          | Linter output: 0 errors         | Partial check, extrapolation   |\n| Build succeeds        | Build command: exit 0           | Linter passing, logs look good |\n| Bug fixed             | Test original symptom: passes   | Code changed, assumed fixed    |\n| Regression test works | Red-green cycle verified        | Test passes once               |\n| Agent completed       | VCS diff shows changes          | Agent reports \"success\"        |\n| Requirements met      | Line-by-line checklist          | Tests passing                  |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Using \"should\", \"probably\", \"seems to\"\n- Expressing satisfaction before verification (\"Great!\", \"Perfect!\", \"Done!\", etc.)\n- About to commit/push/PR without verification\n- Trusting agent success reports\n- Relying on partial verification\n- Thinking \"just this once\"\n- Tired and wanting work over\n- **ANY wording implying success without having run verification**\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse                                  | Reality                |\n| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| \"Should work now\"                       | RUN the verification   |\n| \"I''m confident\"                         | Confidence ≠ evidence  |\n| \"Just this once\"                        | No exceptions          |\n| \"Linter passed\"                         | Linter ≠ compiler      |\n| \"Agent said success\"                    | Verify independently   |\n| \"I''m tired\"                             | Exhaustion ≠ excuse    |\n| \"Partial check is enough\"               | Partial proves nothing |\n| \"Different words so rule doesn''t apply\" | Spirit over letter     |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**Tests:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run test command] [See: 34/34 pass] \"All tests pass\"\n❌ \"Should pass now\" / \"Looks correct\"\n```\n\n**Regression tests (TDD Red-Green):**\n\n```\n✅ Write → Run (pass) → Revert fix → Run (MUST FAIL) → Restore → Run (pass)\n❌ \"I''ve written a regression test\" (without red-green verification)\n```\n\n**Build:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run build] [See: exit 0] \"Build passes\"\n❌ \"Linter passed\" (linter doesn''t check compilation)\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n```\n✅ Re-read plan → Create checklist → Verify each → Report gaps or completion\n❌ \"Tests pass, phase complete\"\n```\n\n**Agent delegation:**\n\n```\n✅ Agent reports success → Check VCS diff → Verify changes → Report actual state\n❌ Trust agent report\n```\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nFrom 24 failure memories:\n\n- your human partner said \"I don''t believe you\" - trust broken\n- Undefined functions shipped - would crash\n- Missing requirements shipped - incomplete features\n- Time wasted on false completion → redirect → rework\n- Violates: \"Honesty is a core value. If you lie, you''ll be replaced.\"\n\n## When To Apply\n\n**ALWAYS before:**\n\n- ANY variation of success/completion claims\n- ANY expression of satisfaction\n- ANY positive statement about work state\n- Committing, task completion\n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:33:14.137Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing rigorous verification and validation of claims through evidence-based completion","zh":"非常适合需要通过基于证据的完成严格验证和验证的开发代理","ja":"開発エージェントが主張の厳格な検証と検証を証拠に基づいて完了する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"严格한 검증 및 검증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una verificación y validación rigurosa de las afirmaciones a través de la finalización basada en evidencia","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin d''une vérification et d''une validation rigoureuses des allégations grâce à l''achèvement basé sur des preuves","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine strengen Überprüfung und Validierung von Behauptungen durch evidenzbasierte Vervollständigung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de verificação e validação rigorosas de afirmações por meio de conclusão baseada em evidências","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима строгая проверка и подтверждение заявлений на основе доказательств","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تحتاج إلى التحقق والتحقق الدقيق من المطالبات من خلال الإكمال المستند إلى الأدلة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure honesty and efficiency by enforcing the core principle of evidence before claims, utilizing protocols like terminal-based verification commands for visibility and freshness of verification evidence, adhering to the iron law of no completion claims without fresh verification evidence","zh":"赋予代理人通过执行基于证据的主张的核心原则来确保诚实和效率的能力，利用诸如终端基于的验证命令等协议以实现验证证据的可见性和新鲜度，遵循无新鲜验证证据不完成主张的铁律","ja":"エージェントが証拠に基づく主張のコアプリンシプルを実施することで、誠実性と効率性を確保する能力を付与します。たとえば、ターミナルベースの検証コマンドなどのプロトコルを使用して、検証証拠の可視性と新鮮度を実現し、新鮮な検証証拠がない場合の完了主張の鉄の法則に従います。","ko":"에이전트가 증거 기반의 주장의 핵심 원칙을 시행하여誠實性과 효율성을 보장하는 능력을 부여합니다. 예를 들어, 터미널 기반의 검증 명령과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 검증 증거의 가시성과 신선도를 구현하며, 신선한 검증 증거가 없는 경우의 완료 주장의 철의 법칙을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a garantizar la honestidad y la eficiencia al aplicar el principio fundamental de evidencia antes de las afirmaciones, utilizando protocolos como comandos de verificación basados en terminal para la visibilidad y la frescura de la evidencia de verificación, y cumpliendo con la ley de hierro de no afirmaciones de finalización sin evidencia de verificación fresca","fr":"Habilite les agents à garantir l''honnêteté et l''efficacité en appliquant le principe fondamental de preuve avant les allégations, en utilisant des protocoles tels que des commandes de vérification basées sur le terminal pour la visibilité et la fraîcheur des preuves de vérification, et en respectant la loi de fer de pas d''allégations de finalisation sans preuves de vérification fraîches","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Ehrlichkeit und Effizienz sicherzustellen, indem sie das Kernprinzip der Beweise vor den Behauptungen durchsetzen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie terminalbasierten Überprüfungsbefehlen für die Sichtbarkeit und Frische der Überprüfungsbeweise, und indem sie das eisernes Gesetz des nicht-Vervollständigens von Behauptungen ohne frische Überprüfungsbeweise einhalten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a honestidade e a eficiência, aplicando o princípio fundamental de evidências antes de reivindicar, utilizando protocolos como comandos de verificação baseados em terminal para visibilidade e frescor das evidências de verificação, aderindo à lei de ferro de nenhuma reivindicação de conclusão sem evidências de verificação frescas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить честность и эффективность, применяя основной принцип доказательств перед заявлениями, используя протоколы, такие как терминальные команды проверки для видимости и свежести доказательств проверки, придерживаясь железного закона о том, что нет заявлений о завершении без свежих доказательств проверки","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ضمان الشفافية والكفاءة من خلال تطبيق المبدأ الأساسي للأدلة قبل المطالبات، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل أوامر التحقق القائمة على الطرفية للرؤية وfreshness من أدلة التحقق، والامتثال لقانون الحديد لعدم وجود مطالبات إكمال بدون أدلة تحقق tươiة"},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying completion claims through fresh evidence","Enforcing honesty in development workflows","Debugging claims without sufficient evidence"],"zh":["通过新鲜证据验证完成主张","在开发工作流中强制诚实","没有足够证据的调试主张"],"ja":["新鮮な証拠を通じて完了主張の検証","開発ワークフローでの誠実性の強制","十分な証拠のない主張のデバッグ"],"ko":["신선한 증거를 통해 완료 주장의 검증","개발 워크플로에서誠實性을 강제","충분한 증거가 없는 주장의 디버깅"],"es":["Verificar afirmaciones de finalización a través de evidencia fresca","Hacer cumplir la honestidad en los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","Depurar afirmaciones sin evidencia suficiente"],"fr":["Vérifier les allégations de finalisation grâce à des preuves fraîches","Faire respecter l''honnêteté dans les flux de travail de développement","Déboguer les allégations sans preuves suffisantes"],"de":["Überprüfen von Vervollständigungsansprüchen durch frische Beweise","Durchsetzen von Ehrlichkeit in Entwicklungswerkflüssen","Fehlerbehebung von Ansprüchen ohne ausreichende Beweise"],"pt":["Verificar afirmações de conclusão por meio de evidências frescas","Impor honestidade nos fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento","Depurar afirmações sem evidências suficientes"],"ru":["Проверка заявлений о завершении с помощью свежих доказательств","Обеспечение честности в рабочих процессах разработки","Отладка заявлений без достаточных доказательств"],"ar":["التحقق من مطالبات الإكمال من خلال أدلة tươiة","فرض الشفافية في سير عمل التطوير","تصحيح الأخطاء في المطالبات بدون أدلة كافية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the iron law of verification","Violating the letter of the rule violates the spirit of the rule","Mandatory terminal-based verification for visibility"],"zh":["需要遵守验证的铁律","违反规则的字母违反规则的精神","强制终端基于的验证以实现可见性"],"ja":["検証の鉄の法則への従順が必要","ルールの文字を違反するとルールの精神を違反する","可視性の実現のために強制ターミナルベースの検証"],"ko":["검증의 철의 법칙을 따르는 것이 필요","규칙의 문자를 위반하면 규칙의 정신을 위반","가시성을 구현하기 위한 강제 터미널 기반의 검증"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a la ley de hierro de la verificación","Violación de la letra de la regla viola el espíritu de la regla","Verificación basada en terminal obligatoria para la visibilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à la loi de fer de la vérification","La violation de la lettre de la règle viole l''esprit de la règle","Vérification basée sur le terminal obligatoire pour la visibilité"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des eisernen Gesetzes der Überprüfung","Verletzung des Wortlautes der Regel verletzt den Geist der Regel","Terminalbasierte Überprüfung obligatorisch für die Sichtbarkeit"],"pt":["Exige adesão à lei de ferro da verificação","Violar a letra da regra viola o espírito da regra","Verificação baseada em terminal obrigatória para visibilidade"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения железного закона проверки","Нарушение буквы правила нарушает дух правила","Обязательная терминальная проверка для видимости"],"ar":["يتطلب الامتثال لقانون الحديد للتحقق","خرق حرف القاعدة يخرق روح القاعدة","التحقق القائم على الطرفية إجباري للرؤية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7a65cc77597a6796efe4538ba53e1c28231d180e95187b2726c0f08e8aec2d5e","qualityScore":39}');
