Release FUNSTACK Skill은 React 애플리케이션의 라우팅을 최적화하는 Router 라이브러리입니다","es":"release-funstack es una biblioteca de enrutamiento para React que utiliza Navigation API","fr":"release-funstack est une bibliothèque de routage pour React qui utilise Navigation API","de":"release-funstack ist eine Router-Bibliothek für React, die Navigation API verwendet","pt":"O que é release-funstack? Uma biblioteca de roteamento para React que utiliza a Navigation API","ru":"Что такое release-funstack? Библиотека маршрутизации для React на основе Navigation API","ar":"ما هي release-funstack؟ مكتبة تحكم الروتر ل React التي تستخدم Navigation API"},"features":{"en":["Updates package.json file based on semantic versioning rules","Confirms version updates with the user before making changes","Follows steps outlined in SKILL.md for releasing new package versions","Supports react and router technologies","Updates route files according to user instructions","Determines current package version from packages/router/package.json file"],"zh":["基于 Navigation API 的路由管理","支持 React 应用","优化路由性能","遵循语义版本规则","更新包版本"],"ja":["Navigation API ベースのルーティング","React アプリ対応","ルーティング パフォーマンスの最適化","シーマンティック バージョニング ルールの遵守","パッケージ バージョンの更新"],"ko":["Navigation API 기반의 라우팅","React 애플리케이션 지원","라우팅 성능 최적화","시맨틱 버전 규칙 준수","패키지 버전 업데이트"],"es":["Enrutamiento basado en Navigation API","Compatibilidad con React","Actualización de versiones mediante semantic versioning","Configuración de paquetes con package.json","Integración con History API legacy"],"fr":["Routage basé sur Navigation API","Compatibilité avec React","Mise à jour des versions via semantic versioning","Configuration de paquets avec package.json","Intégration avec History API legacy"],"de":["Routierung basierend auf Navigation API","Kompatibilität mit React","Versionierung mittels semantic versioning","Konfiguration von Paketen mit package.json","Integration mit History API legacy"],"pt":["Roteamento baseado na Navigation API","Sem necessidade da History API","Integração com React","Atualização de versão baseada em semântica","Confirmação de atualização de versão"],"ru":["Маршрутизация на основе Navigation API","Без необходимости History API","Интеграция с React","Обновление версии на основе семантики","Подтверждение обновления версии"],"ar":["تحكم الروتر على أساس Navigation API","بدون الحاجة إلى History API","التكامل مع React","تحديث الإصدار على أساس السيمانتيك","التأكيد على تحديث الإصدار"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use release-funstack","release-funstack setup guide","release-funstack alternative","release-funstack vs react-router","release-funstack install","what is release-funstack","release-funstack documentation","release-funstack navigation api","release-funstack semantic versioning"],"zh":["Release FUNSTACK Skill","Navigation API","React 路由","Router 库","语义版本规则","AIエージェント","React 性能优化"],"ja":["Release FUNSTACK Skill","Navigation API","React ルーティング","ルーター ライブラリ","シーマンティック バージョニング","AIエージェント","React パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["Release FUNSTACK Skill","Navigation API","React 라우팅","Router 라이브러리","시맨틱 버전","AI 에이전트","React 성능 최적화"],"es":["release-funstack","React","Navigation API","History API legacy","enrutamiento","routage","semantic versioning","package.json","Herramientas de desarrollo de AI"],"fr":["release-funstack","React","Navigation API","History API legacy","routage","enrutamiento","semantic versioning","package.json","Outils de développement d''IA"],"de":["release-funstack","React","Navigation API","History API legacy","Routierung","enrutamiento","semantic versioning","package.json","KI-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["release-funstack","Navigation API","React","roteamento","History API","semântica de versão","configuração de release-funstack","guia de instalação release-funstack"],"ru":["release-funstack","Navigation API","React","маршрутизация","History API","семантика версии","настройка release-funstack","руководство по установке release-funstack"],"ar":["release-funstack","Navigation API","React","تحكم الروتر","History API","سيمانتيك الإصدار","إعداد release-funstack","دليل تركيب release-funstack"]}},"owner":"uhyo","repo":"funstack-router","repoPath":"uhyo/funstack-router","stars":43,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T14:03:12Z","topics":["react","router"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-funstack","description":"A skill to make a GitHub release for the `@funstack/router` package. Use this skill when the user wants to release a new version of the package.","bodyPreview":"# Release FUNSTACK Skill\n\nTo release a new version of the `@funstack/router` package, follow these steps:\n\n1. Read the `packages/router/package.json` file to determine the current version of the package.\n\n- User may or may not have already updated the version in `package.json`. Ask the user to confirm if they have updated the version. If not, you should update the version based on semantic versioning rules (patch, minor, major) as per user''s instruction.\n\n2. Update the version in `packages/route","body":"# Release FUNSTACK Skill\n\nTo release a new version of the `@funstack/router` package, follow these steps:\n\n1. Read the `packages/router/package.json` file to determine the current version of the package.\n\n- User may or may not have already updated the version in `package.json`. Ask the user to confirm if they have updated the version. If not, you should update the version based on semantic versioning rules (patch, minor, major) as per user''s instruction.\n\n2. Update the version in `packages/router/package.json`, commit and push if necessary.\n\n- The commit message should be `chore: bump version to x.y.z` where `x.y.z` is the new version.\n\n3. Inspect the git log since the last release tag to generate release notes.\n\n- The release notes should summarize the changes made since the last release.\n- Especially, highlight any breaking changes, new features, or important fixes.\n\n4. Use the `gh` CLI to create a new release on GitHub with the new version and the generated release notes.\n\n- The tag name should be `x.y.z` where `x.y.z` is the new version.\n\n5. Inform the user that the release has been created successfully, providing the URL to the release page on GitHub.\n\n## Writing Release Notes\n\nWhen writing release notes, consider the following structure:\n\n```markdown\n## What''s Changed\n\n### Breaking Changes\n\n- Change the `onNavigate` signature to accept an `OnNavigateInfo` object instead of the matched array. (#52)\n\n### Features\n\n- Add new hooks `useRouteParams`, `useRouteState` and `useRouteData` for type-safe state management (#50)\n\n### Improvements\n\n- Improve route matching performance by optimizing the matching algorithm (#20)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/uhyo/funstack-router/compare/0.0.1...0.0.2\n```\n\nNotes:\n\n- Highlight breaking changes if any.\n- Group changes into categories like \"Features\", \"Improvements\", \"Fixes\", etc.\n- Documentation updates and dependency updates should be omitted unless they are significant (e.g. breaking changes).\n- Provide a link to the full changelog comparing the previous version and the new version.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:36:34.631Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing automated package versioning and release management for the @funstack/router package.","zh":"非常适合需要自动包版本管理和发布管理的开发者代理，特别是@funstack/router包。","ja":"開発者エージェントが@funstack/routerパッケージの自動パッケージバージョニングとリリース管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"개발자 에이전트가 @funstack/router 패키지의 자동 패키지 버전 관리 및 릴리스 관리를 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una versión de paquete automatizada y gestión de lanzamiento para el paquete @funstack/router.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin d''une version de package automatisée et d''une gestion de publication pour le package @funstack/router.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die eine automatisierte Paketversionierung und Release-Management für das @funstack/router-Paket benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de versionamento de pacote automatizado e gerenciamento de lançamento para o pacote @funstack/router.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым требуется автоматизированное управление версиями пакетов и управление выпусками для пакета @funstack/router.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة إصدار حزمة وأتمتة الإصدار للحزمة @funstack/router."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage semantic versioning updates in package.json and route files, ensuring seamless releases of the @funstack/router package by following semantic versioning rules for patch, minor, and major updates.","zh":"赋予代理管理package.json和路由文件中的语义版本更新的能力，确保@funstack/router包的发布符合补丁、次要和主要更新的语义版本规则。","ja":"エージェントがpackage.jsonとルートファイルのセマンティックバージョンアップデートを管理できるようにし、@funstack/routerパッケージのリリースをパッチ、ミノル、メジャーアップデートのセマンティックバージョニングルールに従って実行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 package.json 및 라우트 파일의 의미적 버전 업데이트를 관리할 수 있도록 하여 @funstack/router 패키지의 릴리스가 패치, 마이너 및 메이저 업데이트의 의미적 버전 규칙을 준수하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar actualizaciones de versiones semánticas en archivos package.json y archivos de rutas, asegurando lanzamientos sin problemas del paquete @funstack/router siguiendo las reglas de versiones semánticas para actualizaciones de parche, menores y principales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les mises à jour de version sémantique dans les fichiers package.json et les fichiers de routes, assurant ainsi des publications sans problème du package @funstack/router en suivant les règles de version sémantique pour les mises à jour de correctif, mineures et majeures.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, semantische Versionierungs-Updates in package.json- und Routendateien zu verwalten, um so eine reibungslose Veröffentlichung des @funstack/router-Pakets unter Einhaltung der semantischen Versionierungsregeln für Patch-, Minor- und Major-Updates sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar atualizações de versionamento semântico no arquivo package.json e nos arquivos de rota, garantindo lançamentos sem problemas do pacote @funstack/router seguindo as regras de versionamento semântico para atualizações de patch, menor e maior.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять обновлениями семантического версионирования в файле package.json и файлах маршрутизации, обеспечивая бесперебойные выпуски пакета @funstack/router в соответствии с правилами семантического версионирования для патч-, минор- и мейджор-обновлений.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من إدارة تحديثات إصدار.Versioning الدلالية في ملف package.json وملفات المسار، مما يضمن إصدارات بدون مشاكل من حزمة @funstack/router اتباعًا لقواعد التدوين الدلالي للإصدارات الفرعية والثانوية والرئيسية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating version updates in package.json files","Updating route files according to the new version","Guiding users through the release process of the @funstack/router package"],"zh":["自动更新package.json文件中的版本更新","根据新版本更新路由文件","引导用户完成@funstack/router包的发布过程"],"ja":["package.jsonファイルのバージョンアップデートを自動化する","新しいバージョンに応じてルートファイルを更新する","ユーザーを@funstack/routerパッケージのリリースプロセスに沿って導く"],"ko":["package.json 파일의 버전 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","새 버전에 따라 라우트 파일을 업데이트하는 것","사용자를 @funstack/router 패키지의 릴리스 프로세스에 따라 안내하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de versión en archivos package.json","Actualizar archivos de rutas según la nueva versión","Guía a los usuarios a través del proceso de lanzamiento del paquete @funstack/router"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de version dans les fichiers package.json","Mettre à jour les fichiers de routes en fonction de la nouvelle version","Guider les utilisateurs à travers le processus de publication du package @funstack/router"],"de":["Automatisieren von Versionierungs-Updates in package.json-Dateien","Aktualisieren von Routendateien gemäß der neuen Version","Anleitung der Benutzer durch den Veröffentlichungsprozess des @funstack/router-Pakets"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de versão em arquivos package.json","Atualizar arquivos de rota de acordo com a nova versão","Orientar os usuários pelo processo de lançamento do pacote @funstack/router"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления версий в файлах package.json","Обновлять файлы маршрутизации в соответствии с новой версией","Направлять пользователей через процесс выпуска пакета @funstack/router"],"ar":["أتمتة تحديثات الإصدار في ملفات package.json","تحديث ملفات المسار وفقًا للإصدار الجديد","توجيه المستخدمين من خلال عملية إصدار حزمة @funstack/router"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the packages/router/package.json file","Limited to managing the @funstack/router package","User input required for confirming version updates"],"zh":["需要访问packages/router/package.json文件","仅限于管理@funstack/router包","需要用户输入来确认版本更新"],"ja":["packages/router/package.jsonファイルへのアクセスが必要","@funstack/routerパッケージの管理のみ","バージョンアップデートの確認にはユーザー入力が必要"],"ko":["packages/router/package.json 파일에 대한 접근 권한이 필요함","@funstack/router 패키지 관리에만 한정됨","버전 업데이트를 확인하려면 사용자 입력이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo packages/router/package.json","Limitado a la gestión del paquete @funstack/router","Se requiere entrada del usuario para confirmar actualizaciones de versión"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au fichier packages/router/package.json","Limité à la gestion du package @funstack/router","Une entrée utilisateur est requise pour confirmer les mises à jour de version"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Datei packages/router/package.json","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung des @funstack/router-Pakets","Benutzereingabe erforderlich, um Versionierungs-Updates zu bestätigen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo packages/router/package.json","Limitado ao gerenciamento do pacote @funstack/router","Entrada do usuário necessária para confirmar atualizações de versão"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу packages/router/package.json","Ограничен управлением пакетом @funstack/router","Требуется ввод пользователя для подтверждения обновлений версий"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف packages/router/package.json","محدود لإدارة حزمة @funstack/router","مطلوب إدخال المستخدم لتأكيد تحديثات الإصدار"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7f90a61240242a2e4483a216eb19a875411c76d8682863479c4ff092740dc405","qualityScore":38}');
