,"ja":"sdd-verifyは、実際の実装と仕様、設計、タスクの一致性を検証するAIエージェントです","ko":"sdd-verify는 실제 구현과 사양, 설계, 태스크의 일관성을 검증하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"sdd-verify es un agente de inteligencia artificial que verifica la implementación real contra las especificaciones, diseño y tareas","fr":"sdd-verify est un outil d''intelligence artificielle qui vérifie la mise en œuvre réelle contre les specs, conception et tâches","de":"sdd-verify ist ein KI-Agent, der die tatsächliche Implementierung gegen Spezifikationen, Design und Aufgaben überprüft","pt":"O sdd-verify é uma ferramenta de verificação de implementação que garante a qualidade da implementação","ru":"Sdd-verify - это ИИ Агент для верификации реализации, обеспечивающий качество реализации","ar":"sdd-verify هي أداة تحقق من التنفيذ التي تضمن جودة التنفيذ"},"features":{"en":["Verifies ALL implementation against specs, design, and tasks","Compares delta specs from specs/ directory","Checks completeness using project config from openspec/config.yaml","Receives proposal.md content and tasks.md content with completion status","Acts as a quality gate to find gaps, mismatches, and issues"],"zh":["比较实际实现与规范、设计和任务","检测差异、不匹配和问题","使用项目配置文件openspec/config.yaml","接收orchestrator的proposal.md内容和delta specs","检查完成状态"],"ja":["実際の実装と仕様、設計、タスクを比較する","ギャップ、不一致、問題を検出する","プロジェクト設定ファイルopenspec/config.yamlを使用する","orchestratorからのproposal.md内容とdelta specsを受け取る","完了状態を確認する"],"ko":["实际 구현과 사양, 설계, 태스크를 비교한다","차이, 불일치, 문제를 발견한다","프로젝트 설정 파일 openspec/config.yaml을 사용한다","orchestrator로부터 proposal.md 내용과 delta specs를 받는다","완료 상태를 확인한다"],"es":["Verificación de implementaciones contra specs y diseño","Análisis de deltas de specs desde specs/","Verificación de tareas y estado de completación","Integración con project config desde openspec/config.yaml","Comprobación de completitud de la implementación"],"fr":["Vérification des mises en œuvre par rapport aux specs et conception","Analyse des deltas de specs depuis specs/","Vérification des tâches et état de complétion","Intégration avec project config depuis openspec/config.yaml","Vérification de la complétude de la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Überprüfung von Implementierungen gegen Spezifikationen und Design","Analyse von Deltas von Spezifikationen seit specs/","Überprüfung von Aufgaben und Fertigstellungsstatus","Integration mit project config von openspec/config.yaml","Überprüfung der Vollständigkeit der Implementierung"],"pt":["Verificação de completude da implementação","Compara a implementação real com os specs, design e tarefas","Recebe dados do orchestrator, incluindo proposal.md, delta specs e project config","Verifica a implementação contra as especificações e design","Identifica lacunas e problemas na implementação"],"ru":["Проверка завершенности реализации","Сравнивает фактическую реализацию с спецификациями, дизайном и задачами","Получает данные от оркестратора, включая proposal.md, delta specs и project config","Проверяет реализацию против спецификаций и дизайна","Выявляет пробелы и проблемы в реализации"],"ar":["تحقق من اكتمال التنفيذ","يقارن التنفيذ الفعلي بالمواصفات والتصميم والمهام","يستقبل البيانات من المنسق، بما في ذلك proposal.md و delta specs و project config","يحقق من التنفيذ ضد المواصفات والتصميم","يحدد الفجوات والمشكلات في التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use sdd-verify","sdd-verify setup guide","what is sdd-verify","sdd-verify alternative","sdd-verify vs other verification tools","sdd-verify install","verification sub-agent","AI agent quality gates","spec verification"],"zh":["sdd-verify","AIエージェント","验证工具","实际实现","规范","设计","任务","项目配置","openspec/config.yaml"],"ja":["sdd-verify","AIエージェント","検証ツール","実際の実装","仕様","設計","タスク","プロジェクト設定","openspec/config.yaml"],"ko":["sdd-verify","AI 에이전트","검증 도구","실제 구현","사양","설계","태스크","프로젝트 설정","openspec/config.yaml"],"es":["sdd-verify","agentes de inteligencia artificial","verificación de implementaciones","specs y diseño","integración con YAML","desarrollo de software","calidad del código","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["sdd-verify","outils d''intelligence artificielle","vérification des mises en œuvre","specs et conception","intégration avec YAML","développement de logiciels","qualité du code","outils de développement"],"de":["sdd-verify","KI-Agents","Überprüfung von Implementierungen","Spezifikationen und Design","Integration mit YAML","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["sdd-verify","verificação de implementação","ferramenta de verificação","specs","design","tarefas","orchestrator","proposal.md","delta specs","project config"],"ru":["sdd-verify","верификация реализации","ИИ Агент","спецификации","дизайн","задачи","оркестратор","proposal.md","delta specs","project config"],"ar":["sdd-verify","أداة تحقق من التنفيذ","تحقق من التنفيذ","المواصفات","التصميم","المهام","المنسق","proposal.md","delta specs","project config"]}},"owner":"nicolad","repo":"nomadically.work","repoPath":"nicolad/nomadically.work","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T14:18:00Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sdd-verify","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## Purpose\n\nYou are a sub-agent responsible for VERIFICATION. You compare the actual implementation against the specs, design, and tasks to find gaps, mismatches, and issues. You are the quality gate.\n\n## What You Receive\n\nFrom the orchestrator:\n- Change name\n- The `proposal.md` content\n- The delta specs from `specs/`\n- The `design.md` content\n- The `tasks.md` content (with completion status)\n- Project config from `openspec/config.yaml`\n\n## What to Do\n\n### Step 1: Check Completeness\n\nVerify ALL","body":"## Purpose\n\nYou are a sub-agent responsible for VERIFICATION. You compare the actual implementation against the specs, design, and tasks to find gaps, mismatches, and issues. You are the quality gate.\n\n## What You Receive\n\nFrom the orchestrator:\n- Change name\n- The `proposal.md` content\n- The delta specs from `specs/`\n- The `design.md` content\n- The `tasks.md` content (with completion status)\n- Project config from `openspec/config.yaml`\n\n## What to Do\n\n### Step 1: Check Completeness\n\nVerify ALL tasks are done:\n\n```\nRead tasks.md\n├── Count total tasks\n├── Count completed tasks [x]\n├── List incomplete tasks [ ]\n└── Flag: CRITICAL if core tasks incomplete, WARNING if cleanup tasks incomplete\n```\n\n### Step 2: Check Correctness (Specs Match)\n\nFor EACH spec requirement and scenario:\n\n```\nFOR EACH REQUIREMENT in specs/:\n├── Search codebase for implementation evidence\n├── For each SCENARIO:\n│   ├── Is the GIVEN precondition handled?\n│   ├── Is the WHEN action implemented?\n│   ├── Is the THEN outcome produced?\n│   └── Are edge cases covered?\n└── Flag: CRITICAL if requirement missing, WARNING if scenario partially covered\n```\n\n### Step 3: Check Coherence (Design Match)\n\nVerify design decisions were followed:\n\n```\nFOR EACH DECISION in design.md:\n├── Was the chosen approach actually used?\n├── Were rejected alternatives accidentally implemented?\n├── Do file changes match the \"File Changes\" table?\n└── Flag: WARNING if deviation found (may be valid improvement)\n```\n\n### Step 4: Check Testing\n\nVerify test coverage for spec scenarios:\n\n```\nSearch for test files related to the change\n├── Do tests exist for each spec scenario?\n├── Do tests cover happy paths?\n├── Do tests cover edge cases?\n├── Do tests cover error states?\n└── Flag: WARNING if scenarios lack tests, SUGGESTION if coverage could improve\n```\n\n### Step 5: Save Verification Report\n\nCreate the verification report file:\n\n```\nopenspec/changes/{change-name}/\n├── proposal.md\n├── specs/\n├── design.md\n├── tasks.md\n└── verify-report.md          ← You create this\n```\n\n### Step 6: Return Summary\n\nReturn to the orchestrator the same content you wrote to `verify-report.md`:\n\n```markdown\n## Verification Report\n\n**Change**: {change-name}\n\n### Completeness\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Tasks total | {N} |\n| Tasks complete | {N} |\n| Tasks incomplete | {N} |\n\n{List incomplete tasks if any}\n\n### Correctness (Specs)\n| Requirement | Status | Notes |\n|------------|--------|-------|\n| {Req name} | ✅ Implemented | {brief note} |\n| {Req name} | ⚠️ Partial | {what''s missing} |\n| {Req name} | ❌ Missing | {not implemented} |\n\n**Scenarios Coverage:**\n| Scenario | Status |\n|----------|--------|\n| {Scenario name} | ✅ Covered |\n| {Scenario name} | ⚠️ Partial |\n| {Scenario name} | ❌ Not covered |\n\n### Coherence (Design)\n| Decision | Followed? | Notes |\n|----------|-----------|-------|\n| {Decision name} | ✅ Yes | |\n| {Decision name} | ⚠️ Deviated | {how and why} |\n\n### Testing\n| Area | Tests Exist? | Coverage |\n|------|-------------|----------|\n| {area} | Yes/No | {Good/Partial/None} |\n\n### Issues Found\n\n**CRITICAL** (must fix before archive):\n{List or \"None\"}\n\n**WARNING** (should fix):\n{List or \"None\"}\n\n**SUGGESTION** (nice to have):\n{List or \"None\"}\n\n### Verdict\n{PASS / PASS WITH WARNINGS / FAIL}\n\n{One-line summary of overall status}\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n- ALWAYS read the actual source code — don''t trust summaries\n- Compare against SPECS first (behavioral correctness), DESIGN second (structural correctness)\n- Flag creation of bash script files (.sh) as a CRITICAL violation — never create bash scripts in repository\n- Be objective — report what IS, not what should be\n- CRITICAL issues = must fix before archive\n- WARNINGS = should fix but won''t block\n- SUGGESTIONS = improvements, not blockers\n- If tests exist, run them if possible and report results\n- DO NOT fix any issues — only report them. The orchestrator decides what to do.\n- In `openspec` mode, ALWAYS save the report to `openspec/changes/{change-name}/verify-report.md` — this persists the verification for sdd-archive and the audit trail\n- Apply any `rules.verify` from `openspec/config.yaml`\n- Return a structured envelope with: `status`, `executive_summary`, `detailed_report` (optional), `artifacts`, `next_recommended`, and `risks`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:13:36.425Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring rigorous verification and quality control, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, to ensure implementation integrity against specs and design","zh":"适用于需要严格的验证和质量控制的开发代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code，以确保实现的完整性与规格和设计相符","ja":"厳格な検証と品質管理を必要とする開発エージェント、たとえばCursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeに適しています。仕様と設計に対する実装の完全性を保証するためです","ko":"严格한 검증과 품질 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트例如 Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code에 적합합니다. 명세와 설계에 대한 구현의 무결성을 보장하기 위함입니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una verificación y control de calidad rigurosos, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, para garantizar la integridad de la implementación frente a las especificaciones y el diseño","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement nécessitant une vérification et un contrôle de qualité rigoureux, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, pour assurer l''intégrité de la mise en œuvre par rapport aux spécifications et à la conception","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine strenge Verifizierung und Qualitätskontrolle erfordern, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, um die Implementierungsintegrität gegenüber Spezifikationen und Design sicherzustellen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem verificação rigorosa e controle de qualidade, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, para garantir a integridade da implementação contra especificações e design","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих тщательной проверки и контроля качества, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, для обеспечения целостности реализации по отношению к спецификациям и дизайну","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب التحقق الصارم ومراقبة الجودة، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code، لضمان سلامة التنفيذ ضد المواصفات والتصميم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to meticulously compare actual implementation against specs, design, and tasks, identifying gaps and mismatches through delta specs analysis from ''specs/'' and project config from ''openspec/config.yaml'', thereby ensuring robust quality gates","zh":"赋予代理以细致地比较实际实现与规格、设计和任务之间的差异，通过从''specs/''和项目配置''openspec/config.yaml''中进行delta specs分析，从而确保强大的质量关卡","ja":"エージェントに実装を仕様、設計、タスクと比較してギャップや不一致を特定するdelta specs分析を実行する力を与え、強力な品質ゲートを確保します。''specs/''とプロジェクト設定''openspec/config.yaml''から","ko":"에이전트에 실제 구현과 명세, 설계, 태스크를 비교하여 차이와 불일치를 식별하는 델타 스펙 분석을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 강력한 품질 게이트를 보장합니다. ''specs/''와 프로젝트 설정 ''openspec/config.yaml''에서","es":"Habilita a los agentes a comparar minuciosamente la implementación real con las especificaciones, el diseño y las tareas, identificando brechas y discrepancias a través del análisis de especificaciones delta desde ''specs/'' y la configuración del proyecto desde ''openspec/config.yaml'', garantizando así puertas de calidad robustas","fr":"Permet aux agents de comparer avec soin la mise en œuvre réelle avec les spécifications, la conception et les tâches, en identifiant les lacunes et les incohérences à travers l''analyse des spécifications delta depuis ''specs/'' et la configuration du projet depuis ''openspec/config.yaml'', assurant ainsi des portes de qualité robustes","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die tatsächliche Implementierung sorgfältig mit den Spezifikationen, dem Design und den Aufgaben zu vergleichen, Lücken und Ungereimtheiten durch die Analyse der Deltaspezifikationen von ''specs/'' und der Projektkonfiguration von ''openspec/config.yaml'' zu identifizieren und so robuste Qualitätsprüfungen sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a comparar minuciosamente a implementação real contra as especificações, design e tarefas, identificando lacunas e discrepâncias por meio da análise de especificações delta de ''specs/'' e configuração do projeto de ''openspec/config.yaml'', garantindo assim portas de qualidade robustas","ru":"Позволяет агентам тщательно сравнивать фактическую реализацию с спецификациями, дизайном и задачами, выявляя пробелы и несоответствия посредством анализа delta-спецификаций из ''specs/'' и конфигурации проекта из ''openspec/config.yaml'', тем самым обеспечивая прочные ворота качества","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من مقارنة التنفيذ الفعلي بدقة مقابل المواصفات والتصميم والمهام، وتحديد الفجوات والاختلافات من خلال تحليل المواصفات دلتا من ''specs/'' وتهيئة المشروع من ''openspec/config.yaml''، وبالتالي ضمان بوابات جودة قوية"},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying implementation completeness against proposal.md content","Analyzing delta specs for discrepancies","Validating task completion status in tasks.md"],"zh":["验证实现的完整性是否与proposal.md内容一致","分析delta specs以查找差异","验证任务完成状态在tasks.md中"],"ja":["proposal.mdの内容と実装の完全性を検証する","不一致を特定するためのdelta specsを分析する","tasks.mdの中でタスク完了状態を検証する"],"ko":["구현의 완전성을 proposal.md 내용과 일치하는지 확인","불일치를 식별하기 위한 델타 스펙을 분석","tasks.md에서 태스크 완료 상태를 확인"],"es":["Verificar la completitud de la implementación frente al contenido de proposal.md","Analizar las especificaciones delta para detectar discrepancias","Validar el estado de finalización de las tareas en tasks.md"],"fr":["Vérifier l''exhaustivité de la mise en œuvre par rapport au contenu de proposal.md","Analyser les spécifications delta pour détecter les incohérences","Valider l''état d''achèvement des tâches dans tasks.md"],"de":["Überprüfen der Vollständigkeit der Implementierung gegenüber dem Inhalt von proposal.md","Analysieren der Deltaspezifikationen zur Erkennung von Ungereimtheiten","Validieren des Abschlussstatus der Aufgaben in tasks.md"],"pt":["Verificar a completude da implementação contra o conteúdo do proposal.md","Analisar as especificações delta para discrepâncias","Validar o status de conclusão da tarefa em tasks.md"],"ru":["Проверить полноту реализации против содержимого proposal.md","Проанализировать delta-спецификации на несоответствия","Проверить статус завершения задачи в tasks.md"],"ar":["التحقق من إكمال التنفيذ مقابل محتوى proposal.md","تحليل المواصفات دلتا للاختلافات","التحقق من حالة إكمال المهمة في tasks.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to proposal.md, specs/, design.md, tasks.md, and openspec/config.yaml","Dependent on orchestrator for input data"],"zh":["需要访问proposal.md、specs/、design.md、tasks.md和openspec/config.yaml","输入数据的编排器依赖"],"ja":["proposal.md、specs/、design.md、tasks.md、openspec/config.yamlへのアクセスが必要","入力データのオーケストレーターへの依存"],"ko":["proposal.md, specs/, design.md, tasks.md, openspec/config.yaml에 대한 액세스가 필요","입력 데이터의 오케스트레이터에 대한 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a proposal.md, specs/, design.md, tasks.md y openspec/config.yaml","Depende del orchestrator para los datos de entrada"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à proposal.md, specs/, design.md, tasks.md et openspec/config.yaml","Dépend de l''orchestrator pour les données d''entrée"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf proposal.md, specs/, design.md, tasks.md und openspec/config.yaml","Hängt vom Orchestrator für die Eingabedaten ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso a proposal.md, specs/, design.md, tasks.md e openspec/config.yaml","Depende do orchestrator para dados de entrada"],"ru":["Требует доступа к proposal.md, specs/, design.md, tasks.md и openspec/config.yaml","Зависит от orchestrator для входных данных"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى proposal.md و specs/ و design.md و tasks.md و openspec/config.yaml","يعتمد على الوسيط لبيانات الإدخال"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"6fcc2a37fe14cff93faec7e767ee32f451395f9c0cc9991b93a62f580e92c2b3","qualityScore":38}');
