ing React, CSS Grid, Flexbox, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"前端响应式设计是指使用 React、CSS Grid 和 Tailwind CSS 实现的适应不同屏幕尺寸的前端设计","ja":"フロントエンドレスポンシブデザインとは、React、CSS Grid、Flexbox、Tailwind CSS を使用してさまざまな画面サイズに適応するフロントエンド設計のこと","ko":"프론트엔드 반응형 디자인은 React, CSS Grid, Flexbox, Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 다양한 화면 크기에 대응하는 프론트엔드 설계를 말합니다","es":"El frontend responsive se refiere a la capacidad de adaptar la interfaz de usuario a diferentes tamaños de pantalla y dispositivos","fr":"Le frontend responsive fait référence à la capacité d''adapter l''interface utilisateur à différentes tailles d''écran et d''appareils","de":"Das frontend-responsive bezieht sich auf die Fähigkeit, die Benutzeroberfläche an verschiedene Bildschirmgrößen und Geräte anzupassen","pt":"Frontend Responsivo é uma técnica de design que se adapta a diferentes tamanhos de tela","ru":"Отзывчивый Frontend - это техника дизайна, которая адаптируется к разным размерам экрана","ar":"الواجهة الأمامية المتجاوبة هي تقنية تصميم تتناسب مع أحجام الشاشة المختلفة"},"features":{"en":["Provides guidance on creating responsive layouts using CSS Grid and Flexbox","Supports implementation of mobile-first design patterns","Generates responsive utility classes using Tailwind CSS (sm:, md:, lg:, xl:, 2xl:)","Optimizes React components in .tsx or .jsx files for responsive design","Enhances navigation menu development for responsive interfaces"],"zh":["使用 React 实现响应式组件","使用 CSS Grid 和 Flexbox 实现响应式布局","使用 Tailwind CSS 实现响应式utility类","支持移动优先设计模式","支持导航菜单实现"],"ja":["React を使用してレスポンシブなコンポーネントを実現","CSS Grid と Flexbox を使用してレスポンシブなレイアウトを実現","Tailwind CSS を使用してレスポンシブな utility クラスを実現","モバイルファースト設計パターンのサポート","ナビゲーションメニューの実現"],"ko":["React를 사용하여 반응형 컴포넌트를 구현","CSS Grid와 Flexbox를 사용하여 반응형 레이아웃을 구현","Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 반응형 utility 클래스를 구현","모바일 우선 설계 패턴 지원","내비게이션 메뉴 구현"],"es":["Implementación de diseños responsivos con React y CSS","Uso de CSS Grid y Flexbox para crear layouts responsivos","Creación de componentes responsivos con Tailwind CSS","Diseño para dispositivos móviles con patrones de diseño mobile-first","Creación de menús de navegación responsivos"],"fr":["Mise en place de conceptions responsives avec React et CSS","Utilisation de CSS Grid et Flexbox pour créer des dispositions responsives","Création de composants responsifs avec Tailwind CSS","Conception pour les appareils mobiles avec des modèles de conception mobile-first","Création de menus de navigation responsifs"],"de":["Umsetzung responsiver Designs mit React und CSS","Verwendung von CSS Grid und Flexbox zur Erstellung responsiver Layouts","Erstellung responsiver Komponenten mit Tailwind CSS","Entwurf für mobile Geräte mit Entwurfsmustern für mobile Geräte","Erstellung responsiver Navigationsmenüs"],"pt":["Criação de componentes React responsivos","Implementação de layouts com CSS Grid e Flexbox","Uso de classes de utilidade responsiva do Tailwind CSS","Desenvolvimento de padrões de design para dispositivos móveis","Criação de menus de navegação responsivos"],"ru":["Создание отзывчивых компонентов React","Реализация макетов с помощью CSS Grid и Flexbox","Использование отзывчивых утилитных классов Tailwind CSS","Разработка паттернов дизайна для мобильных устройств","Создание отзывчивых меню навигации"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات React متجاوبة","تنفيذ تصاميم باستخدام CSS Grid و Flexbox","استخدام فصول مساعدة متجاوبة من Tailwind CSS","تطوير أنماط تصميم للهواتف المحمولة","إنشاء قوائم导航 متجاوبة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use frontend-responsive","frontend-responsive setup guide","responsive frontend development best practices","Tailwind CSS utility classes tutorial","mobile-first design patterns examples","frontend-responsive vs responsive web design","install frontend-responsive","frontend-responsive alternative"],"zh":["前端响应式设计","React响应式","CSS Grid响应式","Tailwind CSS响应式","移动优先设计","导航菜单实现","AIエージェント","前端开发"],"ja":["フロントエンドレスポンシブデザイン","Reactレスポンシブ","CSS Gridレスポンシブ","Flexboxレスポンシブ","Tailwind CSSレスポンシブ","モバイルファースト設計","ナビゲーションメニュー","AIエージェント","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 반응형 디자인","React반응형","CSS Grid반응형","Flexbox반응형","Tailwind CSS반응형","모바일 우선 설계","내비게이션 메뉴","AI 도구","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["frontend responsive","diseño responsivo","React","CSS Grid","Flexbox","Tailwind CSS","patrones de diseño mobile-first","menús de navegación responsivos","desarrollo web responsivo"],"fr":["frontend responsive","conception responsive","React","CSS Grid","Flexbox","Tailwind CSS","modèles de conception mobile-first","menus de navigation responsifs","développement web responsif"],"de":["frontend-responsive","responsives Design","React","CSS Grid","Flexbox","Tailwind CSS","Entwurfsmuster für mobile Geräte","responsives Navigationsmenü","responsives Webdesign"],"pt":["frontend responsivo","react responsivo","css grid","flexbox","tailwind css","design responsivo","desenvolvimento web responsivo"],"ru":["отзывчивый frontend","react отзывчивый","css grid","flexbox","tailwind css","отзывчивый дизайн","разработка веб-приложений отзывчивых"],"ar":["الواجهة الأمامية المتجاوبة","رياكت متجاوب","سي اس اس گرید","فلكس بوكس","تايل ويند سي اس اس","تصميم متجاوب","تطوير ويب متجاوب"]}},"owner":"Senury","repo":"senury-website","repoPath":"Senury/senury-website","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T15:30:40Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-responsive","description":"Implement mobile-first responsive designs with fluid layouts, breakpoints, relative units, and touch-friendly interfaces that work across all device sizes. Use this skill when writing or modifying React components (.tsx, .jsx files), when implementing CSS or Tailwind responsive utilities (sm:, md:, lg:, xl: breakpoints), when working on layout components, navigation menus, grid systems, when optimizing for mobile devices, tablets, or desktop screens, when implementing media queries, when ensuring touch-friendly UI elements, or when testing cross-device compatibility.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Responsive\n\nThis Skill provides Claude Code with specific guidance on how to adhere to coding standards as they relate to how it should handle frontend responsive.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- When creating or editing React components in `.tsx` or `.jsx` files\n- When implementing responsive layouts using CSS Grid or Flexbox\n- When writing Tailwind CSS responsive utility classes (sm:, md:, lg:, xl:, 2xl:)\n- When implementing mobile-first design patterns\n- When creating navigation menu","body":"# Frontend Responsive\n\nThis Skill provides Claude Code with specific guidance on how to adhere to coding standards as they relate to how it should handle frontend responsive.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- When creating or editing React components in `.tsx` or `.jsx` files\n- When implementing responsive layouts using CSS Grid or Flexbox\n- When writing Tailwind CSS responsive utility classes (sm:, md:, lg:, xl:, 2xl:)\n- When implementing mobile-first design patterns\n- When creating navigation menus that adapt to different screen sizes\n- When working on responsive typography that scales across breakpoints\n- When implementing touch-friendly UI elements (buttons, tap targets, gestures)\n- When optimizing images and assets for different screen sizes and resolutions\n- When testing UI components across mobile, tablet, and desktop breakpoints\n- When using relative units (rem, em, %, vh, vw) instead of fixed pixels\n- When implementing responsive spacing, padding, or margins\n- When creating fluid container layouts that adapt to viewport size\n\n## Instructions\n\nFor details, refer to the information provided in this file:\n[frontend responsive](../../../agent-os/standards/frontend/responsive.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:06:48.446Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing responsive web development capabilities with React, CSS Grid, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要具备 React、CSS Grid 和 Tailwind CSS 响应式 Web 开发能力的前端智能体。","ja":"React、CSS Grid、および Tailwind CSS を使用したレスポンシブな Web 開発機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React, CSS Grid 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용한 반응형 웹 개발 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo web responsivo con React, CSS Grid y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de développement web réactif avec React, CSS Grid et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die responsive Webentwicklungsfähigkeiten mit React, CSS Grid und Tailwind CSS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades de desenvolvimento web responsivo com React, CSS Grid e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы возможности разработки отзывчивых веб-приложений с помощью React, CSS Grid и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الأمامي التي تحتاج إلى قدرات تطوير الويب الاستجابي مع React و CSS Grid و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create responsive layouts using CSS Grid and Flexbox, and implement mobile-first design patterns with Tailwind CSS utility classes like sm:, md:, lg:, xl:, and 2xl:.","zh":"使智能体能够使用 CSS Grid 和 Flexbox 创建响应式布局，并使用 Tailwind CSS 的实用工具类（如 sm:、md:、lg:、xl: 和 2xl:）实现移动优先的设计模式。","ja":"CSS Grid と Flexbox を使用してレスポンシブなレイアウトを作成し、sm:、md:、lg:、xl:、2xl: などの Tailwind CSS ユーティリティクラスを使用してモバイルファーストのデザインパターンを実装することをエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 CSS Grid 및 Flexbox를 사용하여 반응형 레이아웃을 생성하고, sm:, md:, lg:, xl:, 2xl:과 같은 Tailwind CSS 유틸리티 클래스를 사용하여 모바일 퍼스트 디자인 패턴을 구현할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear diseños responsivos utilizando CSS Grid y Flexbox, y a implementar patrones de diseño de primera movilidad con clases de utilidad de Tailwind CSS como sm:, md:, lg:, xl: y 2xl:.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des mises en page réactives à l''aide de CSS Grid et de Flexbox, et de mettre en œuvre des modèles de conception mobiles en premier lieu avec des classes d''utilité Tailwind CSS comme sm:, md:, lg:, xl: et 2xl:.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, responsive Layouts mit CSS Grid und Flexbox zu erstellen und mobile-erst-Designmuster mit Tailwind-CSS-Hilfsklassen wie sm:, md:, lg:, xl: und 2xl: zu implementieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem layouts responsivos usando CSS Grid e Flexbox, e implementem padrões de design para dispositivos móveis com classes de utilidade do Tailwind CSS como sm:, md:, lg:, xl: e 2xl:.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать отзывчивые макеты с помощью CSS Grid и Flexbox, а также реализовывать шаблоны проектирования для мобильных устройств с помощью утилитных классов Tailwind CSS, таких как sm:, md:, lg:, xl: и 2xl:.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من إنشاء تخطيطات استجابة باستخدام CSS Grid و Flexbox، وتنفيذ أنماط تصميم أولية للأجهزة المحمولة باستخدام فئات الأدوات المساعدة من Tailwind CSS مثل sm: و md: و lg: و xl: و 2xl:."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating responsive React components in .tsx or .jsx files","Implementing responsive navigation menus with CSS Grid","Writing Tailwind CSS responsive utility classes for mobile-first design"],"zh":["在 .tsx 或 .jsx 文件中生成响应式 React 组件","使用 CSS Grid 实现响应式导航菜单","为移动优先设计编写 Tailwind CSS 响应式实用工具类"],"ja":[".tsx または .jsx ファイル内でのレスポンシブな React コンポーネントの生成","CSS Grid を使用したレスポンシブなナビゲーションメニューの実装","モバイルファーストデザインのための Tailwind CSS レスポンシブユーティリティクラスの記述"],"ko":[".tsx 또는 .jsx 파일에서 반응형 React 컴포넌트 생성","CSS Grid를 사용한 반응형 네비게이션 메뉴 구현","모바일 퍼스트 디자인을 위한 Tailwind CSS 반응형 유틸리티 클래스 작성"],"es":["Generar componentes de React responsivos en archivos .tsx o .jsx","Implementar menús de navegación responsivos con CSS Grid","Escribir clases de utilidad de Tailwind CSS responsivas para el diseño de primera movilidad"],"fr":["Générer des composants React réactifs dans des fichiers .tsx ou .jsx","Mettre en œuvre des menus de navigation réactifs avec CSS Grid","Écrire des classes d''utilité Tailwind CSS réactives pour la conception mobile en premier lieu"],"de":["Erstellen von responsiven React-Komponenten in .tsx- oder .jsx-Dateien","Implementieren von responsiven Navigationsmenüs mit CSS Grid","Schreiben von responsiven Tailwind-CSS-Hilfsklassen für mobile-erst-Design"],"pt":["Geração de componentes React responsivos em arquivos .tsx ou .jsx","Implementação de menus de navegação responsivos com CSS Grid","Escrita de classes de utilidade responsiva do Tailwind CSS para design de primeiro dispositivo móvel"],"ru":["Генерация отзывчивых компонентов React в файлах .tsx или .jsx","Реализация отзывчивых меню навигации с помощью CSS Grid","Написание отзывчивых утилитных классов Tailwind CSS для мобильного первого дизайна"],"ar":["توليد مكونات React استجابة في ملفات .tsx أو .jsx","تنفيذ قوائم导航 استجابة باستخدام CSS Grid","كتابة فئات أدوات مساعدة استجابة من Tailwind CSS للتصميم الأول للأجهزة المحمولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React, CSS Grid, and Tailwind CSS","Limited to frontend development tasks"],"zh":["需要具备 React、CSS Grid 和 Tailwind CSS 的知识","仅限于前端开发任务"],"ja":["React、CSS Grid、および Tailwind CSS の知識が必要","フロントエンド開発タスクに限定される"],"ko":["React, CSS Grid 및 Tailwind CSS에 대한 지식 필요","프론트엔드 개발 작업으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React, CSS Grid y Tailwind CSS","Limitado a tareas de desarrollo frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React, CSS Grid et Tailwind CSS","Limité aux tâches de développement frontend"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React, CSS Grid und Tailwind CSS","Begrenzt auf Frontend-Entwicklungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React, CSS Grid e Tailwind CSS","Limitado a tarefas de desenvolvimento frontend"],"ru":["Требует знания React, CSS Grid и Tailwind CSS","Ограничен задачами разработки frontend"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و CSS Grid و Tailwind CSS","محدود بمهام تطوير الواجهة الأمامية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"debe4598217dfd3be8bc0f040d8159db8cd327606ad620c4c1da4e378181267a","qualityScore":38}');
