INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Emz1998/avaris-ai/backlog', 'backlog', 'Emz1998', 'avaris-ai', 'community', 'backlog Emz1998 avaris-ai community The backlog skill helps developers create and maintain a structured backlog.md file, enabling efficient project management. It benefits development teams by organizing tasks and priorities. Backlog 是一个用于管理项目的结构化文件，使用模板和优先级可以高效地管理项目 バックログはプロジェクトを管理するための構造化されたファイルです。テンプレートと優先順位を使用して効率的にプロジェクトを管理できます 백로그는 프로젝트를 관리하는 데 사용되는 구조화된 파일입니다. 템플릿과 우선순위를 사용하여 효율적으로 프로젝트를 관리할 수 있습니다 El backlog es un componente clave en el desarrollo ágil, que permite priorizar y organizar las tareas del proyecto de manera eficiente. Le backlog est un élément clé dans le développement agile, permettant de prioriser et d''organiser les tâches du projet de manière efficace. Das Backlog ist ein wichtiger Bestandteil im agilen Entwicklung, das die Priorisierung und Organisation der Projekttaufgaben ermöglicht. O backlog é um arquivo estruturado que contém epics, histórias e tarefas para melhorar a produtividade da equipe Backlog - это структурированный файл, содержащий эпические истории и задачи для управления проектами ال백لوغ هو ملف منظم يحتوي على قصص و مهام لتحسين أداء الفريق how to use backlog in project management what is backlog management backlog setup guide for developers backlog vs agile project management backlog install and configuration structured project management with backlog prioritizing tasks in backlog backlog alternative for development teams backlog best practices for AI agents backlog 管理 项目管理工具 AI 工具 优先级设置 结构化文件 Epics 和 Stories Tasks 和 Spikes 全局 ID 顺序 ID Generates a structured backlog.md file using a template at template/backlog.md Organizes tasks into epics, stories, and tasks with global IDs and prefixes Supports priority levels: Must have, Should have, Nice to have, and Spikes Creates tasks at sprint level with IDs starting with T-NNN Maintains a hierarchy of epics containing stories with IDs like US-NNN, TS-NNN, BG-NNN, SK-NNN Backlog is a structured project management approach using a backlog.md file to organize epics, stories, and tasks with priority levels and global IDs.');
