on ジョブを提供","ko":"Upstash QStash는 서버리스 메시징 솔루션으로 안정적인 HTTP인/아웃과 크론잡을 제공","es":"Upstash QStash es una herramienta de mensajería serverless que utiliza HTTP para programar y entregar mensajes de forma confiable","fr":"Upstash QStash est un outil de messagerie sans serveur qui utilise HTTP pour planifier et livrer des messages de manière fiable","de":"Upstash QStash ist ein Tool für serverlose Messaging, das HTTP verwendet, um Nachrichten zuverlässig zu planen und zu liefern","pt":"Upstash QStash é uma ferramenta de mensagens serverless que fornece confiabilidade e simplicidade","ru":"Upstash QStash - это инструмент для серверных сообщений, который обеспечивает надежность и простоту","ar":"Upstash QStash هو أداة لأجهزة النصية الخادمة التي توفر موثوقية و بساطة"},"features":{"en":["Schedules millions of messages with reliability","Sets up cron jobs that run for years","Builds webhook delivery systems that never drop a message","Uses HTTP in and out for simplicity","Provides reliable message delivery"],"zh":["支持 HTTP 调用","cron 作业调度","可靠的消息队列","简化的 HTTP 的イン/アウト","支持 webhook 交付","毫秒级的消息调度"],"ja":["HTTP のイン/アウトをサポート","cron ジョブのスケジューリング","信頼性の高いメッセージキュー","HTTP のイン/アウトを簡素化","webhook 配信をサポート","ミリ秒レベルのメッセージスケジューリング"],"ko":["HTTP인/아웃 지원","크론잡 스케줄링","안정적인 메시지 큐","HTTP인/아웃 단순화","웹훅 전달 지원","밀리초 단위 메시지 스케줄링"],"es":["Mensajería serverless con HTTP","Programación de millones de mensajes","Creación de sistemas de entrega de webhooks","Compatibilidad con cron jobs para ejecución de tareas periódicas","Entrega de mensajes confiable con garantía de entrega"],"fr":["Messagerie sans serveur avec HTTP","Planification de millions de messages","Création de systèmes de livraison de webhooks","Compatibilité avec les tâches cron pour l''exécution de tâches périodiques","Livraison de messages fiable avec garantie de livraison"],"de":["Serverlose Messaging mit HTTP","Planung von Millionen von Nachrichten","Erstellung von Webhook-Lieferungssystemen","Kompatibilität mit Cron-Jobs für die Ausführung von periodischen Aufgaben","Zuverlässige Nachrichtenlieferung mit Liefergarantie"],"pt":["Mensagens serverless com HTTP in, HTTP out","Cron jobs para agendamento de mensagens","Entrega de webhooks confiável","Simplicidade e facilidade de uso"],"ru":["Серверные сообщения с HTTP в, HTTP из","Задачи в фоне для планирования сообщений","Надежная доставка вебхуков","Простота и легкость использования"],"ar":["أجهزة النصية الخادمة مع HTTP في، HTTP خارج","وظائف الكرون لجدولة الرسائل","توصيل الويب هوك الموثوق","البساطة وسهولة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use upstash-qstash","what is upstash-qstash","upstash-qstash alternative","upstash-qstash vs amazon sqs","upstash-qstash install","upstash-qstash setup guide","reliable serverless messaging","http-based message scheduling"],"zh":["Upstash QStash","服务器无消息队列","HTTP 调用","cron 作业","可靠的消息队列","AIエージェント","服务器无架构"],"ja":["Upstash QStash","サーバーレスメッセージング","HTTP のイン/アウト","cron ジョブ","信頼性の高いメッセージキュー","AIエージェント","サーバーレスアーキテクチャ"],"ko":["Upstash QStash","서버리스 메시징","HTTP인/아웃","크론잡","안정적인 메시지 큐","AI 에이전트","서버리스 아키텍처"],"es":["Upstash QStash","mensajería serverless","HTTP","programación de mensajes","sistemas de entrega de webhooks","cron jobs","entrega de mensajes confiable"],"fr":["Upstash QStash","messagerie sans serveur","HTTP","planification de messages","systèmes de livraison de webhooks","tâches cron","livraison de messages fiable"],"de":["Upstash QStash","serverlose Messaging","HTTP","Nachrichtenplanung","Webhook-Lieferungssysteme","Cron-Jobs","zuverlässige Nachrichtenlieferung"],"pt":["Upstash QStash","mensagens serverless","HTTP in, HTTP out","cron jobs","entrega de webhooks","ferramentas de mensagens","serviços de mensagens","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Upstash QStash","ИИ Агенты","серверные сообщения","HTTP в, HTTP из","задачи в фоне","доставка вебхуков","инструменты для сообщений","сервисы для сообщений","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["Upstash QStash","الأجهزة النصية الخادمة","أدوات الأجهزة النصية","HTTP في، HTTP خارج","وظائف الكرون","توصيل الويب هوك","خدمات الأجهزة النصية","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"jacksonemmerich","repo":"farmapub","repoPath":"jacksonemmerich/farmapub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T19:31:21Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash-qstash","description":"Upstash QStash expert for serverless message queues, scheduled jobs, and reliable HTTP-based task delivery without managing infrastructure. Use when: qstash, upstash queue, serverless cron, schedul...","bodyPreview":"# Upstash QStash\n\nYou are an Upstash QStash expert who builds reliable serverless messaging\nwithout infrastructure management. You understand that QStash''s simplicity\nis its power - HTTP in, HTTP out, with reliability in between.\n\nYou''ve scheduled millions of messages, set up cron jobs that run for years,\nand built webhook delivery systems that never drop a message. You know that\nQStash shines when you need \"just make this HTTP call later, reliably.\"\n\nYour core philosophy:\n1. HTTP is the univers","body":"# Upstash QStash\n\nYou are an Upstash QStash expert who builds reliable serverless messaging\nwithout infrastructure management. You understand that QStash''s simplicity\nis its power - HTTP in, HTTP out, with reliability in between.\n\nYou''ve scheduled millions of messages, set up cron jobs that run for years,\nand built webhook delivery systems that never drop a message. You know that\nQStash shines when you need \"just make this HTTP call later, reliably.\"\n\nYour core philosophy:\n1. HTTP is the universal language - no c\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- qstash-messaging\n- scheduled-http-calls\n- serverless-cron\n- webhook-delivery\n- message-deduplication\n- callback-handling\n- delay-scheduling\n- url-groups\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Basic Message Publishing\n\nSending messages to be delivered to endpoints\n\n### Scheduled Cron Jobs\n\nSetting up recurring scheduled tasks\n\n### Signature Verification\n\nVerifying QStash message signatures in your endpoint\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Skipping Signature Verification\n\n### ❌ Using Private Endpoints\n\n### ❌ No Error Handling in Endpoints\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Not verifying QStash webhook signatures | critical | # Always verify signatures with both keys: |\n| Callback endpoint taking too long to respond | high | # Design for fast acknowledgment: |\n| Hitting QStash rate limits unexpectedly | high | # Check your plan limits: |\n| Not using deduplication for critical operations | high | # Use deduplication for critical messages: |\n| Expecting QStash to reach private/localhost endpoints | critical | # Production requirements: |\n| Using default retry behavior for all message types | medium | # Configure retries per message: |\n| Sending large payloads instead of references | medium | # Send references, not data: |\n| Not using callback/failureCallback for critical flows | medium | # Use callbacks for critical operations: |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `vercel-deployment`, `nextjs-app-router`, `redis-specialist`, `email-systems`, `supabase-backend`, `cloudflare-workers`\n\n## When to Use\nThis skill is applicable to execute the workflow or actions described in the overview.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:14:31.194Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Serverless Agents needing reliable messaging and cron job scheduling via HTTP","zh":"非常适合需要可靠消息传递和通过 HTTP 进行 cron 作业调度的 Serverless Agents","ja":"HTTP 経由で信頼性の高いメッセージングと cron ジョブのスケジューリングが必要な Serverless Agents に最適","ko":"HTTP를 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 메시징과 크론 잡 스케줄링이 필요한 서버리스 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes sin servidor que necesitan mensajería confiable y programación de trabajos cron a través de HTTP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents sans serveur nécessitant un messagisme fiable et une planification de tâches cron via HTTP","de":"Perfekt für Serverless-Agents, die zuverlässige Messaging und Cron-Job-Planung über HTTP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Serverless que necessitam de mensagens confiáveis e agendamento de trabalhos cron via HTTP","ru":"Идеально для агентов Serverless, которым требуются надежные сообщения и планирование заданий cron через HTTP","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الخادمين الذين يحتاجون إلى رسائل موثوقة وتخطيط مهام cron عبر HTTP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build reliable serverless messaging systems with HTTP in, HTTP out, and reliability in between, using Upstash QStash for scheduling messages and setting up cron jobs, ideal for developers needing to integrate webhook delivery systems","zh":"赋予代理构建可靠的服务器无消息系统的能力，使用 HTTP 输入，HTTP 输出和中间的可靠性，使用 Upstash QStash 进行消息调度和设置 cron 作业，适合需要集成 webhook 投递系统的开发人员","ja":"エージェントが Upstash QStash を使用してメッセージをスケジュールし、cron ジョブを設定し、HTTP 入力、HTTP 出力、そして中間の信頼性で信頼性の高いサーバーレス メッセージング システムを構築できるようにする。Webhook 配信システムを統合する必要がある開発者に最適","ko":"Upstash QStash를 사용하여 메시지를 스케줄링하고 크론 잡을 설정하여 HTTP 입력, HTTP 출력 및 중간의 신뢰성을 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 서버리스 메시징 시스템을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 제공하며 웹후크 배달 시스템을 통합해야 하는 개발자에게 적합","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir sistemas de mensajería confiables sin servidor con HTTP de entrada, HTTP de salida y confiabilidad en el medio, utilizando Upstash QStash para programar mensajes y configurar trabajos cron, ideal para desarrolladores que necesitan integrar sistemas de entrega de webhooks","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des systèmes de messagisme fiables sans serveur avec HTTP en entrée, HTTP en sortie et fiabilité entre les deux, en utilisant Upstash QStash pour planifier des messages et configurer des tâches cron, idéal pour les développeurs qui ont besoin d''intégrer des systèmes de livraison de webhooks","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, zuverlässige Serverless-Messaging-Systeme mit HTTP-Eingabe, HTTP-Ausgabe und Zuverlässigkeit dazwischen zu erstellen, indem Upstash QStash für die Planung von Nachrichten und die Einrichtung von Cron-Jobs verwendet wird, ideal für Entwickler, die Webhook-Liefer-systeme integrieren müssen","pt":"Habilita agentes a construir sistemas de mensagens serverless confiáveis com HTTP de entrada, HTTP de saída e confiabilidade no meio, usando Upstash QStash para agendar mensagens e configurar trabalhos cron, ideal para desenvolvedores que precisam integrar sistemas de entrega de webhooks","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать надежные системы обмена сообщениями serverless с HTTP на входе, HTTP на выходе и надежностью посередине, используя Upstash QStash для планирования сообщений и настройки заданий cron, идеально для разработчиков, которым необходимо интегрировать системы доставки веб-хуков","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء أنظمة رسائل خادمية موثوقة مع HTTP للدخول ، HTTP للخروج والموثوقية في المنتصف ، باستخدام Upstash QStash لجدولة الرسائل وتهيئة مهام cron ، مثالية للمطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج أنظمة توصيل الويب هوك"},"useCases":{"en":["Scheduling millions of messages with guaranteed delivery","Setting up cron jobs for recurring tasks","Building webhook delivery systems with zero message loss"],"zh":["使用保证递送调度数百万条消息","设置 cron 作业以执行重复任务","使用 Upstash QStash 构建零消息丢失的 webhook 投递系统"],"ja":["配信保証付きで数百万件のメッセージをスケジュールする","繰り返しタスクの実行のための cron ジョブを設定する","Upstash QStash を使用してメッセージ喪失ゼロの Webhook 配信システムを構築する"],"ko":["보장된 배달을 사용하여 수백만 개의 메시지를 예약","반복 작업을 수행하기 위한 크론 잡을 설정","Upstash QStash를 사용하여 메시지 손실이 없는 웹후크 배달 시스템을 구축"],"es":["Programar millones de mensajes con entrega garantizada","Configurar trabajos cron para tareas recurrentes","Construir sistemas de entrega de webhooks con pérdida de mensajes cero"],"fr":["Planifier des millions de messages avec livraison garantie","Configurer des tâches cron pour des tâches récurrentes","Construire des systèmes de livraison de webhooks avec perte de messages zéro"],"de":["Millionen von Nachrichten mit garantierter Zustellung planen","Cron-Jobs für wiederkehrende Aufgaben einrichten","Webhook-Liefer-Systeme mit Null-Nachrichtenverlust erstellen"],"pt":["Agendamento de milhões de mensagens com entrega garantida","Configuração de trabalhos cron para tarefas recorrentes","Construção de sistemas de entrega de webhooks com perda de mensagem zero"],"ru":["Планирование миллионов сообщений с гарантированной доставкой","Настройка заданий cron для повторяющихся задач","Создание систем доставки веб-хуков с нулевой потерей сообщений"],"ar":["جدولة ملايين الرسائل مع تسليم مضمون","تهيئة مهام cron للأعمال المتكررة","بناء أنظمة توصيل الويب هوك بفقدان رسالة صفر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Upstash QStash account","Infrastructure management not included"],"zh":["需要 Upstash QStash 账户","不包括基础设施管理"],"ja":["Upstash QStash アカウントが必要","インフラストラクチャの管理は含まれない"],"ko":["Upstash QStash 계정이 필요","인프라 관리는 포함되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Upstash QStash","No se incluye la administración de infraestructura"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Upstash QStash","La gestion de l''infrastructure n''est pas incluse"],"de":["Benötigt ein Upstash QStash-Konto","Infrastrukturverwaltung ist nicht enthalten"],"pt":["Exige conta Upstash QStash","Gerenciamento de infraestrutura não incluído"],"ru":["Требуется аккаунт Upstash QStash","Управление инфраструктурой не включено"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Upstash QStash","إدارة البنية التحتية غير مدرجة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e2326fed56112197d6da66b4551d4d3f6e666eb2d127d4232e0285c574d829ab","qualityScore":38}');
